inates\":[[[207.125,-173.875],[208.125,-173.625],[208.875,-173],[209.3125,-171.625],[209.4375,-170.75],[209.5625,-169.625],[209.375,-168.625],[208.75,-168.25],[207.9375,-166.6875],[208.3125,-165.375],[208.875,-164.5625],[210.125,-163.8125],[211.0625,-163.0625],[211.5625,-164.1875],[212.75,-163.5],[213.625,-163.4375],[214.875,-161.6875],[215.5,-160.625],[215.3125,-159.3125],[216.6875,-158.9375],[217.4375,-158.125],[217.625,-157.4375],[218.8125,-157.625],[219.3125,-156.5625],[221.125,-156.0625],[222.1875,-156.125],[223.3125,-155.5],[224.5625,-155.3125],[225.5,-154.875],[225.75,-153.4375],[226.75,-153.5],[227.4375,-153.8125],[228.0625,-152.8125],[228.0625,-151.8125],[228.6875,-151],[229.375,-150.1875],[230.375,-149.9375],[231,-148.4375],[232.3125,-147.875],[232.625,-146.8125],[231.75,-145.5625],[232.625,-144.3125],[233.5,-143.25],[234.375,-143.8125],[234.9375,-142.25],[236.375,-141],[237,-140.25],[237.625,-140.25],[237.875,-141.8125],[238.8125,-141.1875],[240,-140.875],[240.75,-140.5],[241.6875,-141.6875],[242.375,-141.5625],[242.5,-140.375],[243.75,-141.25],[244.75,-141.8125],[245.125,-140.125],[245.8125,-140.375],[246.9375,-139],[247.8125,-139.625],[248.5625,-139],[248.1875,-137.8125],[248.5,-137.25],[250.1875,-137.0625],[251.5625,-137.625],[252.75,-137.375],[253.9375,-137.125],[255.25,-137.0625],[255.875,-137.25],[255.875,-174.0625],[207.125,-173.875]]]}}','#c108ce',NULL,10,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,NULL),(125,400,NULL,3,19,20,'Nom_125','<p>Cette solide forteresse construire sur un territoire semi-d&eacute;sertique est l\'&eacute;picentre du pouvoir du puissant Comte de Valbroso dont le pouvoir commence &agrave; s&eacute;rieusement concurrencer celui du Roi de Zingara. De plus en plus nombreux sont ceux qui le voient comme un recours depuis les &eacute;checs de l\'arm&eacute;e royale face &agrave; l\'invasion Argosienne.&nbsp;<br /><br />A noter que l\'ombre du Temple de Zath construit ici a quelque chose de sinistres pour celles et ceux qui la croisent tout les jours. Pour autant depuis sa construction il y a quelques ann&eacute;es sa renomm&eacute;e croit et les p&egrave;lerins commencent &agrave; y venir. Un sanctuaire &agrave; la gloire de l\'araign&eacute;e y a &eacute;t&eacute; &eacute;rig&eacute; par ses fid&egrave;les augmentant encore l\'aff&ucirc;t de fid&egrave;les, mena&ccedil;ant ainsi les Aquiloniens qui semblent m&eacute;contents...&nbsp;</p>','Chà¢teau Valbroso',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[22.375,-85.765625],[22.5,-85.296875],[22.953125,-85.125],[23.34375,-84.953125],[23.875,-84.8125],[24.296875,-84.734375],[24.5,-84.390625],[24.828125,-84.015625],[25.1875,-83.640625],[25.625,-83.328125],[26.03125,-83.078125],[26.46875,-82.859375],[26.96875,-82.859375],[27.34375,-82.8125],[27.703125,-82.671875],[27.84375,-82.3125],[28.03125,-82.015625],[28.21875,-81.65625],[28.40625,-81.390625],[28.6875,-81.21875],[29.265625,-81.28125],[29.75,-81.390625],[30.234375,-81.53125],[30.609375,-81.59375],[31,-81.765625],[31.390625,-82.078125],[31.9375,-82.28125],[32.34375,-82.53125],[32.9375,-82.703125],[33.25,-82.953125],[33.578125,-83.21875],[33.96875,-83.5],[34.296875,-83.6875],[34.71875,-83.90625],[34.484375,-84.171875],[34.25,-84.5],[34,-84.921875],[33.734375,-85.421875],[33.390625,-85.796875],[33.015625,-86.296875],[32.671875,-86.671875],[32.28125,-86.96875],[31.828125,-87.125],[31.25,-87.15625],[30.84375,-87.046875],[30.5,-86.984375],[30.109375,-87.125],[29.984375,-87.515625],[29.921875,-87.9375],[29.765625,-88.234375],[29.390625,-88.171875],[28.96875,-88.0625],[28.328125,-87.875],[27.6875,-87.625],[26.953125,-87.484375],[26.015625,-87.28125],[25.390625,-87.0625],[24.765625,-86.84375],[24.1875,-86.546875],[23.59375,-86.390625],[23.09375,-86.203125],[22.6875,-86],[22.375,-85.765625]]]}}','#adffc0',89,10,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,NULL),(126,401,NULL,3,19,20,'Nom_126','<p>Depuis que le comte de Korzetta a trouv&eacute; la mort, le fief a &eacute;t&eacute; annex&eacute; par le pouvoir central de Kordava. Chateau Korzetta est construit en surplomb de la ville portuaire de Jerida. Tout le fief est recouvert de riches terres agricoles copieusement irrigu&eacute;es. La cavalerie de Korzetta est particuli&egrave;rement r&eacute;put&eacute;e. A noter que l\'on pr&eacute;tend que le culte de Dagon est ici r&eacute;pandue chez certaines famille de p&ecirc;cheurs.</p>','Chà¢teau Korzetta',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[22.78125,-98.484375],[22.359375,-98.296875],[22.15625,-98.0625],[22.046875,-97.609375],[21.75,-97.34375],[21.328125,-97.171875],[21,-97.078125],[20.53125,-96.96875],[20.296875,-96.734375],[20.1875,-96.328125],[20.203125,-95.890625],[20.359375,-95.59375],[20.40625,-95.25],[20.0625,-95.3125],[19.71875,-95.375],[19.421875,-95.375],[19.171875,-95.171875],[18.859375,-94.96875],[18.609375,-94.734375],[18.5,-94.546875],[18.203125,-94.59375],[17.953125,-94.625],[17.71875,-94.515625],[17.4375,-94.0625],[17.4375,-93.609375],[17.453125,-93.203125],[17.546875,-92.796875],[17.65625,-92.5],[17.796875,-92.140625],[17.8125,-91.828125],[17.6875,-91.484375],[17.515625,-91.140625],[17.421875,-90.859375],[17.421875,-90.390625],[17.484375,-89.796875],[17.703125,-89.375],[18.015625,-89.109375],[18.546875,-88.875],[19.140625,-88.46875],[19.546875,-88.09375],[19.75,-87.4375],[19.84375,-86.84375],[19.90625,-86.53125],[20.390625,-86.21875],[20.90625,-86.078125],[21.546875,-85.96875],[22,-85.96875],[22.328125,-85.75],[22.609375,-85.953125],[22.953125,-86.109375],[23.34375,-86.234375],[23.796875,-86.453125],[24.21875,-86.671875],[24.65625,-86.75],[25.109375,-86.90625],[25.796875,-87.140625],[26.5,-87.328125],[27.171875,-87.5],[27.890625,-87.703125],[28.609375,-87.953125],[29.15625,-88.0625],[29.734375,-88.265625],[29.703125,-88.640625],[29.59375,-89.109375],[29.453125,-89.546875],[29.34375,-90.046875],[29.171875,-90.390625],[28.921875,-90.625],[28.625,-90.921875],[28.359375,-91.125],[28.0625,-91.46875],[27.8125,-91.75],[27.6875,-92.203125],[27.453125,-92.5],[27.3125,-92.828125],[27.078125,-93.21875],[26.875,-93.4375],[26.734375,-93.78125],[26.515625,-94.125],[26.296875,-94.65625],[26.3125,-95.265625],[26.34375,-95.859375],[26.46875,-96.40625],[26.609375,-96.71875],[26.046875,-96.828125],[25.609375,-96.84375],[25.28125,-96.90625],[24.9375,-96.90625],[24.46875,-96.90625],[24.109375,-97.0625],[23.75,-97.34375],[23.40625,-97.65625],[23.171875,-97.90625],[23,-98.21875],[22.78125,-98.484375]]]}}','#9ac5ed',NULL,15,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,NULL),(127,401,NULL,3,19,20,'Nom_127','<p>Kordava est le centre Historique de Zingara. La ville &eacute;ponyme en est la capitale et le si&egrave;ge de la royaut&eacute;. Ils sont environs 50 000 &agrave; r&eacute;sider derri&egrave;re les murs de cette ville portuaire. Le n&eacute;goce a ici un r&ocirc;le important, on y vend des produits de la mer mais aussi des denr&eacute;es import&eacute;es parfois de tr&egrave;s loin. Parmi les sp&eacute;cialit&eacute;s locales&nbsp;on trouve une &eacute;cole de bretteur parmi les plus r&eacute;put&eacute;es d\'hybor&eacute;e.&nbsp;<br /><br />A noter que la guerre a consid&eacute;rablement appauvrit la population et que les efforts de relance &eacute;conomique n\'ont semble t\'il pas encore port&eacute;s leurs fruits, du moins pas pour le bas peuple.&nbsp;</p>','Kordava',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[14.484375,-85.8125],[14.9375,-85.9375],[15.265625,-86],[15.609375,-85.921875],[15.96875,-85.671875],[16.34375,-85.46875],[16.65625,-85.265625],[16.953125,-85.046875],[17.296875,-84.875],[17.78125,-84.625],[18.15625,-84.4375],[18.640625,-84.375],[18.921875,-84.5],[19.28125,-84.53125],[19.765625,-84.5],[20.234375,-8