ked=\"false\" Priority=\"48\" Name=\"List Table 3 Accent 5\"/>\r\n  <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"49\" Name=\"List Table 4 Accent 5\"/>\r\n  <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"50\" Name=\"List Table 5 Dark Accent 5\"/>\r\n  <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"51\"\r\n   Name=\"List Table 6 Colorful Accent 5\"/>\r\n  <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"52\"\r\n   Name=\"List Table 7 Colorful Accent 5\"/>\r\n  <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"46\"\r\n   Name=\"List Table 1 Light Accent 6\"/>\r\n  <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"47\" Name=\"List Table 2 Accent 6\"/>\r\n  <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"48\" Name=\"List Table 3 Accent 6\"/>\r\n  <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"49\" Name=\"List Table 4 Accent 6\"/>\r\n  <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"50\" Name=\"List Table 5 Dark Accent 6\"/>\r\n  <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"51\"\r\n   Name=\"List Table 6 Colorful Accent 6\"/>\r\n  <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"52\"\r\n   Name=\"List Table 7 Colorful Accent 6\"/>\r\n </w:LatentStyles>\r\n</xml><![endif]--><!-- [if gte mso 10]>\r\n<style>\r\n /* Style Definitions */\r\n table.MsoNormalTable\r\n	{mso-style-name:\"Tableau Normal\";\r\n	mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0;\r\n	mso-tstyle-colband-size:0;\r\n	mso-style-noshow:yes;\r\n	mso-style-priority:99;\r\n	mso-style-parent:\"\";\r\n	mso-padding-alt:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n	mso-para-margin-top:0cm;\r\n	mso-para-margin-right:0cm;\r\n	mso-para-margin-bottom:8.0pt;\r\n	mso-para-margin-left:0cm;\r\n	line-height:107%;\r\n	mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\r\n	font-size:11.0pt;\r\n	font-family:\"Calibri\",sans-serif;\r\n	mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\r\n	mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\n	mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;\r\n	mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;}\r\n</style>\r\n<![endif]-->Cette partie d&eacute;sertique du Darfar abrite les tribus Tibu; qui sont d\'essence stygienne, comme peuvent l\'&ecirc;tre les Chagas de Kush. Et m&ecirc;me si ces tribus masqu&eacute;es ne sont pas cannibales, ce sont de puissants alli&eacute;s des Darfari. <span style=\"font-family: \'Helvetica\',sans-serif;\">C&rsquo;est dans cette r&eacute;gion que se trouve le Lac de la Mort. Il s&rsquo;agit d&rsquo;un lac aux eaux tumultueuses et froides situ&eacute; &agrave; l&rsquo;ouest de Xuchotl. L&rsquo;&icirc;le des tribus Ichiribu se trouve en son centre. A l&rsquo;ouest s&rsquo;&eacute;l&egrave;vent les collines foresti&egrave;res et au d&eacute;l&agrave;, les contreforts du Mont Tonnerre. Sous la surface, dit-on, moisiraient les ruines de la Cit&eacute; de Pierre&hellip;</span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[72.75,-117.546875],[72.21875,-117.359375],[71.90625,-117.15625],[71.984375,-117.703125],[72.234375,-118.21875],[72.5,-118.578125],[72.4375,-119.140625],[72.3125,-119.78125],[72.34375,-120.296875],[72.640625,-120.90625],[73.046875,-121.3125],[73.546875,-121.296875],[74.03125,-121.3125],[74.484375,-121.65625],[75.1875,-121.90625],[75.8125,-122.0625],[76.59375,-122.390625],[77.078125,-122.390625],[77.671875,-122.734375],[78.28125,-122.828125],[78.8125,-122.828125],[79.265625,-122.828125],[79.78125,-123.109375],[80.0625,-123.234375],[79.90625,-122.796875],[79.90625,-122.3125],[79.859375,-121.75],[79.5625,-121.234375],[79.15625,-120.84375],[78.765625,-120.609375],[78.46875,-120.171875],[78.5,-119.671875],[78.546875,-119.171875],[78.671875,-118.828125],[78.21875,-118.671875],[77.703125,-118.46875],[77.0625,-118.15625],[76.46875,-117.765625],[75.90625,-117.734375],[75.109375,-117.734375],[74.390625,-117.734375],[73.734375,-117.671875],[73.234375,-117.59375],[72.75,-117.546875]]]}}','#fff0b7',20,10,2,NULL,NULL,'instable',NULL,1,NULL),(163,381,NULL,3,1,22,'Nom_163','<p>Le coin doit son nom &agrave; la vaste \"prairie\" qui entoure la grande ville Darfarienne de Xucholt. En guide de prairies c\'est plut&ocirc;t un vaste d&eacute;sert entrecoup&eacute; de cactus qui vous attend ici. Celui ci est presque parfaitement rond et la vile est son &eacute;picentre. Autour la jungle imp&eacute;n&eacute;trable et violente reprend ses droits. Ici on est dans le coeur du Darfar. &nbsp;Les habitants &eacute;voluent g&eacute;n&eacute;ralement enti&egrave;rement nus et musculeux, leurs dents taill&eacute;es en pointes et pratiquant l\'anthropophagie. &nbsp;Les notables en revanche se parent de m&eacute;taux pr&eacute;cieux et d\'ivoire, souvent en se per&ccedil;ant avec le nez ou d\'autres parties de leur anatomie. Quand &agrave; Xucholt&nbsp;c\'est une &eacute;trange cit&eacute;e en ruine perdue au coeur de la jungle, totalement ovale entour&eacute;e de grands murs et dont on dit que l\'int&eacute;rieur est fait de jade et de lapis lazulis.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[78.59375,-119.015625],[78.828125,-118.734375],[79.484375,-118.421875],[80.125,-118.03125],[80.75,-117.6875],[81.15625,-117.359375],[81.609375,-117.046875],[82.21875,-116.78125],[82.5,-116.375],[83.078125,-116.453125],[83.6875,-116.546875],[84.015625,-116.625],[84.265625,-117.109375],[84.421875,-117.4375],[84.921875,-117.6875],[85.296875,-118.0625],[85.578125,-118.609375],[85.78125,-119.046875],[85.53125,-119.546875],[85.3125,-120.34375],[85.1875,-120.984375],[85.15625,-121.546875],[84.578125,-121.984375],[84.015625,-122.21875],[83.546875,-122.59375],[83,-122.8125],[82.4375,-122.921875],[81.9375,-123.28125],[81.328125,-123.34375],[80.578125,-123.25],[80,-123.28125],[79.890625,-122.734375],[79.890625,-122.140625],[79.828125,-121.65625],[79.515625,-121.203125],[79.0625,-120.875],[78.859375,-120.609375],[78.53125,-120.296875],[78.453125,-119.734375],[78.5,-119.328125],[78.59375,-119.015625]]]}}','#7ef274',20,10,2,NULL,NULL,'instable',NULL,1,NULL),(164,381,NULL,3,1,8,'Nom_164','<p dir=\"ltr\">C&rsquo;est la ruine d&rsquo;une cit&eacute; des anciens fondateurs qui abrite le l&eacute;gendaire tr&eacute;sor des Dents de Gwahlur. L&rsquo;Oracle d&rsquo;Alkmeenon, la Princesse Yelaya, ferait des d&eacute;clarations et divinations. La Princesse Yelaya &eacute;tait la derni&egrave;re dirigeante d&rsquo;Alkmeenon et, quand elle mourru, son jeune et magnifique corps ne se putr&eacute;fie pas. Son esprit est suppos&eacute; &ecirc;tre l&rsquo;Oracle. Les pr&ecirc;tres anciens venaient &agrave; elle pour apprendre la sagesse mais cela ne se fait plus depuis qu&rsquo;un pr&ecirc;tre a essay&eacute; de voler les Dents de Gwalur. Le pr&ecirc;tre Gorulga a re institu&eacute; cette tradition. La cit&eacute; est localis&eacute;e dans le coin sud ouest du royaume dans une jungle inhabit&eacute;e, et tabou pour le commun des Keshani. Le palais royal d&rsquo;Alkmeenon est entour&eacute; par d\'&eacute;normes falaises formant un vaste amphith&eacute;&acirc;tre naturel de 3 ou 4 miles de diam&egrave;tre infranchissable, mais avec quelques passages secrets connus des pr&ecirc;tres de Keshia seuls. Un de ces passages secret est sur la face sud de la vall&eacute;e o&ugrave; il y a un vaste bassin &agrave; la base des falaises. Sous la surface de l&rsquo;eau, il y a une entr&eacute;e de cave qui am&egrave;ne dans la cit&eacute; d&rsquo;Alkmeenon. La cit&eacute; elle-m&ecirc;me se trouve en dehors des falaises, engloutie par la jungle. La jungle a aussi investi l&rsquo;interieur de la cit&eacute;, les arbres-lotus qui grandissent au sud du mur de falaises et bordent l&rsquo;avenue qui m&egrave;ne au palais. Une rivi&egrave;re malsaine d&rsquo;une eau glac&eacute;e, noire passe sous le palace et les Dents de Gwahlur, richesse d&rsquo;une epoque, sont tomb&eacute;es dans cette eau sombre et froide.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">La Stygie a poursuivi sa conqu&ecirc;te du Darfar puis du Keshan en prenant ce fief.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[85.203125,-117.84375],[85.734375,-117.59375],[86.421875,-117.25],[87.1875,-117],[87.984375,-117],[88.59375,-117.296875],[89.234375,-117.375],[89.796875,-117.546875],[90.53125,-117.796875],[91.125,-118.109375],[91.578125,-118.59375],[91.9375,-119.171875],[92.140625,-119.78125],[92.015625,-120.265625],[91.84375,-120.890625],[91.859375,-121.609375],[91.671875,-122.25],[91.640625,-122.875],[91.5625,-123.453125],[90.734375,-123.4375],[90.203125,-123.328125],[89.765625,-122.984375],[89.265625,-122.75],[88.703125,-122.921875],[88.203125,-123.203125],[87.6875,-123.171875],[87.234375,-123.09375],[86.875,-122.765625],[86.515625,-122.34375],[85.921875,-122.0625],[85.265625,-121.671875],[85.109375,-121],[85.203125,-120.296875],[85.40625,-119.625],[85.796875,-119.09375],[85.46875,-118.34375],[85.203125,-117.84375]]]}}','#81f0f4',262,5,3,NULL,NULL,'stable',NULL,2,NULL),(165,381,NULL,3,1,NULL,'Nom_165','<p>Un territoire de jungle chaude et humide peupl&eacute;e de dangers insoup&ccedil;onn&eacute;s et de cr&eacute;atures venues d\'un autre &acirc;ge.</p>\r\n<p>Ils ont fait les frais de l\'invasion stygienne.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[92.625,-124.546875],[93.046875,-123.796875],[93.3125,-123.21875],[93.703125,-122.703125],[94.234375,-122.375],[94.9375,-121.921875],[95.765625,-121.6875],[96.78125,-121.703125],[97.4375,-121.8125],[98.09375,-122.109375],[98.6875,-122.375],[99.359375,-122.5625],[99.9375,-122.875],[100.578125,-122.984375],[101.265625,-123.21875],[101.171875,-123.96875],[101.109375,-124.765625],[101.015625,-125.21875],[100.984375,-125.84375],[100.96875,-126.390625],[100.671875,-127.109375],[100.21875,-127.53125],[99.859375,-127.859375],[99.75,-128.359375],[99.328125,-129],[98.96875,-129.203125],[98.515625,-128.96875],[98.171875,-128.609375],[97.90625,-127.921875],[97.546875,-127.46875],[97.21875,-127.234375],[97.09375,-126.78125],[96.640625,-126.421875],[96.046875,-126.40625],[95.515625,-126.40625],[95.203125,-126.328125],[94.734375,-125.828125],[94.234375,-125.9375],[93.59375,-125.6875],[93.0625,-125.265625],[92.78125,-124.859375],[92.625,-124.546875]]]}}','#f28ee3',262,10,3,NULL,NULL,'stable',NULL,2,NULL),(166,17,NULL,3,1,8,'Nom_166','<p dir=\"ltr\">C&rsquo;est ici que se trouve la capitale de Keshan. La cit&eacute; royale n&rsquo;est rien de plus qu&rsquo;un essaim de paillottes mass&eacute; autour d&rsquo;un mur de boue qui entoure un palais construit en pierres, boue et bambou. Il y a une population de 6549 &acirc;mes. Les conteurs sur les places de march&eacute; aiment raconter des histoires de tr&eacute;sors enfouis dans la l&eacute;gendaire Alkmeenon: des joyaux uniques : rubis, emeraudes, diamants, un tr&ocirc;ne fait enti&egrave;rement d&rsquo;or et de reliques des temps anciens. Une route commerciale relie Keshia et Shem. Les Keshanis aiment les danseuses du Nord et les Shemites sont tr&egrave;s heureux de leur fournir.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[91.53125,-118.46875],[91.921875,-119.140625],[92.1875,-119.90625],[91.96875,-120.359375],[91.828125,-120.953125],[91.765625,-121.6875],[91.734375,-122.421875],[91.578125,-122.984375],[91.53125,-123.296875],[91.828125,-123.546875],[92.015625,-124.0625],[92.4375,-124.578125],[92.84375,-124.078125],[93.296875,-123.390625],[93.65625,-122.765625],[94.203125,-122.4375],[94.84375,-121.984375],[95.4375,-121.671875],[96.390625,-121.578125],[97.046875,-121.59375],[97.578125,-121.84375],[98.078125,-122.140625],[98.640625,-122.4375],[99.296875,-122.53125],[100.015625,-122.84375],[100.671875,-123.015625],[101.28125,-123.234375],[101.53125,-122.78125],[101.734375,-122.25],[101.890625,-121.59375],[102.03125,-121],[102.328125,-120.53125],[102.90625,-120.53125],[103.40625,-120.609375],[104.109375,-120.265625],[104.453125,-119.53125],[104.484375,-118.71875],[104.4375,-118.09375],[104.171875,-117.5625],[103.8125,-116.921875],[103.359375,-116.59375],[102.46875,-116.578125],[101.578125,-116.8125],[100.5,-116.9375],[99.6875,-117.1875],[99.125,-117.34375],[98.34375,-117.6875],[97.6875,-117.984375],[96.59375,-118.34375],[95.796875,-118.15625],[94.875,-118],[94.25,-117.953125],[93.40625,-118.0625],[92.546875,-118.234375],[91.875,-118.34375],[91.53125,-118.46875]]]}}','#b8a8f7',262,10,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,NULL),(167,17,NULL,3,1,NULL,'Nom_167','<p>Territoire o&ugrave; se trouvent les grandes gorges du Styx avec leurs immenses canyons, leurs chutes d\'eau impressionnantes et leur cours sinueux. Le reste de ce territoire est constitu&eacute; de plateaux et de plaines herbeuses o&ugrave; vivent des tribus semi-nomades.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[84,-116.375],[84.53125,-115.8125],[85.265625,-115.53125],[85.828125,-115.3125],[86.65625,-115.203125],[87.546875,-115.171875],[88.078125,-114.734375],[88.828125,-114.21875],[89.328125,-113.703125],[90.109375,-113.390625],[90.921875,-113.234375],[91.78125,-113.46875],[92.359375,-113.84375],[92.90625,-114.3125],[93.78125,-114.359375],[94.796875,-114.46875],[95.734375,-114.6875],[96.5625,-114.78125],[97.25,-114.984375],[97.65625,-115.421875],[98.46875,-115.59375],[99.015625,-115.25],[99.546875,-114.828125],[99.796875,-114.078125],[99.90625,-113.578125],[100.203125,-113.015625],[100.578125,-113.359375],[101.359375,-113.53125],[102.0625,-113.453125],[102.671875,-113.578125],[103.203125,-113.96875],[103.53125,-114.5625],[103.4375,-115.0625],[103.328125,-115.5625],[103.1875,-116.390625],[102.75,-116.671875],[102.125,-116.671875],[101.4375,-116.890625],[100.4375,-117.03125],[99.5625,-117.265625],[98.703125,-117.578125],[97.828125,-117.890625],[97.09375,-118.109375],[96.546875,-118.3125],[95.953125,-118.171875],[95.0625,-118.03125],[94.4375,-117.90625],[93.671875,-118.015625],[92.828125,-118.140625],[92.140625,-118.25],[91.546875,-118.3125],[91.109375,-118.015625],[90.5625,-117.796875],[89.96875,-117.59375],[89.265625,-117.46875],[88.640625,-117.328125],[88.03125,-117.140625],[87.5,-117],[86.875,-117],[86.140625,-117.296875],[85.65625,-117.59375],[85.109375,-117.796875],[84.609375,-117.5625],[84.21875,-117.3125],[84.0625,-116.84375],[84,-116.375]]]}}','#9af4dc',262,10,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,NULL),(168,443,NULL,3,17,12,'Nom_168','<p>Le relief s\'&eacute;l&egrave;ve ici progressivement pour former un paysage compos&eacute; de ces fameuses collines fertiles. Un paysage de vignes en escalier s\'y dessine et est caract&eacute;ristique du coin. A son extr&eacute;mit&eacute; sud c\'est clairement de haut pics infranchissables qui s\'y dressent. La chaine semi-volcanique des escarpements kothiens prend naissance ici et l\'on dit que le seul endroit pour la franchir sans risque est de la contourner par l\'ouest ou d\'aller jusqu\'&agrave; la passe de la route des rois en Khoraja.</p>\r\n<p>Ce territoire a longtemps &eacute;t&eacute; le th&eacute;&acirc;tre de guerres f&eacute;odales entre diff&eacute;rentes cit&eacute;es locales pour la domination sur l&rsquo;ensemble des terres. Depuis une g&eacute;n&eacute;ration maintenant le pouvoir semble s\'y &ecirc;tre stabilis&eacute; autour de El Shahmaddoc. C\'est dans cette ville fortifi&eacute;e de 12 000 habitants que se trouve la demeure du ma&icirc;tre actuel de ces terres&nbsp;: Le seigneur Makoara, un fid&egrave;le soutien du Roi de&nbsp;Koth&nbsp;qui r&egrave;gne ici avec une main de fer dans un gant de fer.</p>\r\n<p>On dit bien des choses sur la fa&ccedil;on dont se d&eacute;roule son r&egrave;gne. On parle en effet de surtaxations qui fragilisent son peuple tandis que lui se vautre dans le luxe. On dit aussi qu\'il aurait fait abattre toutes les statues consacr&eacute;s &agrave; Set et qu\'il aurait travestis celles d\'Ishtar en homme. Rendant culte &agrave; une &eacute;trange version androgyne de la d&eacute;esse fertile. &nbsp;<br /><br />La conqu&ecirc;te de ce fief par Shem s\'est faite dans la douleur. Le sanctuaire a &eacute;t&eacute; d&eacute;truit lors des combats.</p>','El Shahmaddoc',NULL,'Seigneur Makoara',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[59.046875,-88.015625],[59.484375,-87.84375],[60.203125,-87.625],[61,-87.453125],[61.46875,-87.453125],[62.15625,-87.4375],[62.9375,-87.34375],[63.765625,-87.359375],[64.296875,-87.296875],[64.859375,-87.1875],[65.359375,-87.015625],[65.90625,-86.828125],[66.71875,-86.625],[67.34375,-86.609375],[67.84375,-86.390625],[68.171875,-86.203125],[68.671875,-86.21875],[69.328125,-86.15625],[69.84375,-86.0625],[70.375,-86.09375],[70.734375,-86.359375],[71,-86.8125],[71.15625,-87.296875],[71.390625,-87.515625],[71.609375,-87.96875],[71.90625,-88.3125],[71.84375,-88.78125],[72,-89.359375],[72.09375,-89.71875],[71.953125,-90.03125],[72.3125,-90.296875],[72.6875,-90.5625],[72.984375,-90.8125],[73.25,-91.09375],[73.578125,-91.578125],[73.890625,-91.859375],[74.25,-92.25],[74.46875,-92.578125],[73.953125,-92.5625],[73.359375,-92.5625],[72.796875,-92.578125],[72.1875,-92.640625],[71.609375,-92.6875],[71.296875,-92.53125],[71.015625,-92.109375],[70.75,-91.75],[70.328125,-91.5625],[69.859375,-91.3125],[69.5,-91.15625],[69.109375,-91.03125],[68.6875,-91.015625],[68.34375,-91],[68.0625,-91.28125],[67.84375,-91.640625],[67.5,-91.640625],[67.03125,-91.703125],[66.53125,-91.703125],[66.078125,-91.59375],[65.75,-91.5],[65.234375,-91.375],[64.71875,-91.234375],[64.40625,-91.03125],[63.8125,-90.734375],[63.40625,-90.578125],[63,-90.578125],[62.578125,-90.5625],[62.171875,-90.53125],[61.671875,-90.28125],[61.375,-90.046875],[61.234375,-89.8125],[60.859375,-89.546875],[60.546875,-89.359375],[60.1875,-89.359375],[59.75,-89.359375],[59.4375,-89.140625],[59.390625,-88.734375],[59.234375,-88.421875],[59.046875,-88.015625]]]}}','#83e4ef',9,20,2,NULL,NULL,'instable',NULL,2,NULL),(169,416,NULL,3,17,NULL,'Nom_169','<p>C\'est un territoire semi aride qui n\'est pas aussi inhospitalier que les grands d&eacute;serts turaniens ou Stygiens, mais o&ugrave; n&eacute;anmoins la vie est difficile. Par l\'effet combin&eacute; des escarpements kothiens qui bloquent les nuages et emp&ecirc;chent les pr&eacute;cipitations et du lac de sel voisin, la v&eacute;g&eacute;tation c\'est tr&egrave;s peu d&eacute;velopp&eacute; ici donnant cet aspect d&eacute;sertique &agrave; l\'endroit.&nbsp;<br /><br />Quelques oasis subsistent sur lesquelles on trouve g&eacute;n&eacute;ralement des garnisons royales. Pour le reste l\'endroit n\'est pas d&eacute;nu&eacute; de vie humaine et plusieurs tribus de b&eacute;douins nomades parcourent le territoire.&nbsp;<br /><br />La plus puissante et qui rayonne sur les autres est celle conduite par Makara le souriant. Prince de son &eacute;tat et dont la ferveur envers Set n\'a d\'&eacute;gale que sa ruse.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[68.1875,-86.21875],[68.40625,-85.40625],[68.5625,-84.65625],[68.625,-83.84375],[68.65625,-82.90625],[68.65625,-82.1875],[68.859375,-81.828125],[69.4375,-81.59375],[69.859375,-81.53125],[70.28125,-81.65625],[70.875,-81.71875],[71.421875,-81.71875],[71.9375,-81.65625],[72.625,-81.46875],[73.1875,-81.234375],[73.640625,-81.109375],[74.375,-81.171875],[74.984375,-81.25],[75.578125,-81.25],[76.203125,-81.125],[76.578125,-81.015625],[77.015625,-80.875],[77.453125,-80.828125],[78.03125,-80.890625],[78.390625,-81.0625],[78.4375,-81.59375],[78.359375,-82.25],[78.25,-82.796875],[78.265625,-83.328125],[78.203125,-83.703125],[78.0625,-84.171875],[77.984375,-85],[77.421875,-85.203125],[76.8125,-85.421875],[76.15625,-85.65625],[75.65625,-85.8125],[75.140625,-85.90625],[74.484375,-86.0625],[73.828125,-86.09375],[73.234375,-86.171875],[72.6875,-86.1875],[71.953125,-86.34375],[71.4375,-86.546875],[71.015625,-86.78125],[70.796875,-86.453125],[70.40625,-86.171875],[70.09375,-86.0625],[69.671875,-86.078125],[69.0625,-86.15625],[68.53125,-86.203125],[68.1875,-86.21875]]]}}','#b4d7f7',9,10,3,NULL,NULL,'instable',NULL,2,NULL),(170,440,NULL,3,17,NULL,'Nom_170','<p>Ces plateaux volcaniques issus des coul&eacute;es et &eacute;boulements des montagnes de feu, dont le principal&nbsp;: le volcan Khrosha.</p>\r\n<p>Il existe bien des l&eacute;gendes sur ces lieux. Ils tirent leur nom de l\'une d\'entre elles. On pr&eacute;tend en effet qu\'il existerait un r&eacute;seau de galeries inond&eacute;es et de grands lacs souterrains sous ces collines et que cet univers chtonien serait habit&eacute; par de sombres cr&eacute;atures aquatiques&nbsp;: les enfants de Dagoth.</p>\r\n<p>Les &eacute;v&eacute;nements r&eacute;cents dans les montagnes de Khauran avec le r&eacute;veil de ce Dieu donnent un &eacute;cho tout particulier &agrave; ces l&eacute;gendes.</p>\r\n<p>Malgr&eacute; ces sinistres Histoires la vie humaine suis son cours ici. Ces terres ne sont pas particuli&egrave;rement riches mais elles sont tr&egrave;s bien administr&eacute;es par le Seigneur Kalsur qui si&egrave;ge en sa ville de Meshken.&nbsp;<br /><br />Il a la r&eacute;putation d\'&ecirc;tre un brillant strat&egrave;ge dont l\'arm&eacute;e serait la meilleure de tout&nbsp;Koth, mais on dit aussi qu\'il ne rendrait aucun compte au pouvoir royal et n\'aurait m&ecirc;me pas daign&eacute; se d&eacute;placer pour jurer all&eacute;geance au Roi.</p>\r\n<p>C\'est peut-&ecirc;tre pour cela qu\'il se retrouva seul contre les arm&eacute;es sh&eacute;mites qui ont envahi tout le sud du pays. Le bastion a &eacute;t&eacute; ras&eacute;.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[71.046875,-86.75],[71.625,-86.5625],[72.1875,-86.359375],[72.859375,-86.296875],[73.5,-86.265625],[74.421875,-86.109375],[75.109375,-86],[75.6875,-85.75],[76.4375,-85.546875],[77.046875,-85.34375],[77.65625,-85.09375],[78.09375,-84.9375],[78.171875,-85.484375],[78.28125,-86.125],[78.5,-86.703125],[79.015625,-87.90625],[79.453125,-88.453125],[79.78125,-89.03125],[80.078125,-89.546875],[80.546875,-89.96875],[80.8125,-90.359375],[81.359375,-91.203125],[81,-91.46875],[80.671875,-91.46875],[80.328125,-91.484375],[79.875,-91.640625],[79.375,-91.8125],[78.71875,-92.03125],[78.21875,-92.28125],[77.796875,-92.328125],[77.3125,-92.53125],[76.78125,-92.53125],[76.328125,-92.609375],[75.953125,-92.6875],[75.53125,-92.671875],[74.9375,-92.59375],[74.453125,-92.515625],[74.0625,-92.109375],[73.734375,-91.78125],[73.34375,-91.203125],[73.078125,-90.921875],[72.734375,-90.59375],[72.453125,-90.3125],[72.09375,-90.125],[72.046875,-89.703125],[72,-89.34375],[71.765625,-89.015625],[71.859375,-88.671875],[71.921875,-88.34375],[71.765625,-88.03125],[71.484375,-87.734375],[71.234375,-87.484375],[71.09375,-87.078125],[71.046875,-86.75]]]}}','#f7fcab',184,10,2,NULL,NULL,'instable',NULL,2,NULL),(171,416,NULL,3,17,NULL,'Nom_171','<p>Les restes d\'une ancienne mer int&eacute;rieure forment ce long lac sal&eacute; entour&eacute; d\'une terre craquel&eacute;es o&ugrave; poussent les cactus.</p>\r\n<p>L\'industrie du sel a toutefois permis une installation humaine vivace dans les environs et Daramish &ndash; la ville o&ugrave; si&egrave;ge le seigneur local &ndash; est une ville plut&ocirc;t prosp&egrave;re. L\'ordre public y r&egrave;gne et la ville se targue de son calme.&nbsp;<br /><br />La mode vestimentaire ici est tr&egrave;s stricte. Ainsi les hommes comme les femmes sont v&ecirc;tues de longues robes de couleurs simples et les femmes portent des foulards sur la t&ecirc;te.</p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #222222; font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\">Le seigneur Raboron qui r&egrave;gne sur ces terres n\'a pas la r&eacute;putation d\'&ecirc;tre quelqu\'un de tr&egrave;s charismatique, mais sa fid&eacute;lit&eacute; au Roi de&nbsp;Koth&nbsp;n\'est jamais mise en doute. &nbsp;<br /><br /></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[78.265625,-80.859375],[78.421875,-81.390625],[78.375,-81.984375],[78.296875,-82.546875],[78.265625,-83.046875],[78.25,-83.65625],[78.15625,-84.015625],[78.078125,-84.421875],[78.0625,-84.890625],[78.515625,-84.75],[79.03125,-84.59375],[79.703125,-84.359375],[80.1875,-84.109375],[80.71875,-84.046875],[81.15625,-83.8125],[81.828125,-83.8125],[82.453125,-83.765625],[82.9375,-83.75],[83.53125,-83.4375],[83.984375,-83.171875],[84.328125,-82.90625],[84.953125,-82.765625],[85.578125,-82.703125],[86.21875,-82.734375],[86.796875,-82.921875],[87.15625,-83.125],[87.453125,-83.484375],[87.796875,-83.984375],[88.109375,-84.296875],[88.0625,-83.875],[88.0625,-83.46875],[88.1875,-83.03125],[88.40625,-82.765625],[88.71875,-82.484375],[88.96875,-82.015625],[89.28125,-81.640625],[89.375,-81.203125],[89.5625,-80.796875],[89.75,-80.359375],[89.8125,-79.875],[89.703125,-79.78125],[89.265625,-79.875],[88.953125,-79.78125],[88.53125,-79.609375],[87.984375,-79.59375],[87.640625,-79.71875],[87.1875,-79.984375],[86.546875,-80.28125],[85.953125,-80.453125],[85.546875,-80.609375],[85.171875,-80.75],[84.453125,-80.921875],[83.765625,-80.890625],[83.3125,-80.828125],[82.796875,-80.734375],[82.3125,-80.734375],[81.890625,-80.734375],[81.453125,-80.734375],[80.78125,-80.78125],[80.40625,-80.78125],[79.9375,-80.734375],[79.3125,-80.75],[78.78125,-80.8125],[78.265625,-80.859375]]]}}','#9ff9cf',9,20,2,NULL,NULL,'instable',NULL,2,NULL),(172,25,NULL,3,17,NULL,'Nom_172','<p>Une richissime baronnie qui profite pleinement du passage de la route des rois pour faire de florissantes affaires.&nbsp;<br /><br />Culturellement Korveka est tr&egrave;s proche de la Khauran voisine et de fait certains &agrave; la cours royale de&nbsp;Koth&nbsp;craignent son esprit d\'ind&eacute;pendance.</p>\r\n<p>On dit du Baron de Korveka qu\'il serait plus riche que le Roi lui m&ecirc;me, vrai ou pas, sa baronnie a en tout cas les moyens de sa relative autonomie.</p>\r\n<p>Cette opulence a pris fin lorsque Khoraja, soutenu par des arm&eacute;es sh&eacute;mites traditionnelles a pris possession militairement du territoire.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[78.125,-84.9375],[78.484375,-84.765625],[79.09375,-84.59375],[79.859375,-84.3125],[80.65625,-84.09375],[80.953125,-83.859375],[81.6875,-83.796875],[82.296875,-83.734375],[82.90625,-83.6875],[83.421875,-83.515625],[84.015625,-83.234375],[84.40625,-82.890625],[85.125,-82.796875],[85.65625,-82.71875],[86.359375,-82.84375],[86.859375,-82.90625],[87.296875,-83.25],[87.703125,-83.765625],[88,-84.1875],[88.296875,-84.59375],[88.65625,-85.09375],[88.890625,-85.671875],[89.015625,-86.40625],[88.96875,-87.09375],[88.671875,-87.53125],[88.328125,-88.015625],[87.640625,-88.5625],[87.125,-88.90625],[86.671875,-88.96875],[86.078125,-89.078125],[85.515625,-89.078125],[85.015625,-89.03125],[84.6875,-89.015625],[84.34375,-89.296875],[84,-89.65625],[83.671875,-90.046875],[83.46875,-90.453125],[83.109375,-90.546875],[82.671875,-90.625],[82.375,-90.421875],[82.09375,-90.40625],[81.828125,-90.640625],[81.546875,-90.859375],[81.3125,-91.140625],[81.09375,-90.734375],[80.828125,-90.4375],[80.546875,-90.125],[80.375,-89.796875],[79.9375,-89.234375],[79.65625,-88.796875],[79.453125,-88.40625],[79.203125,-88.046875],[78.890625,-87.640625],[78.671875,-87.21875],[78.5,-86.796875],[78.34375,-86.296875],[78.25,-85.859375],[78.046875,-85.46875],[78.125,-84.9375]]]}}','#75aaef',7,20,0,NULL,NULL,'stable',NULL,1,NULL),(173,25,NULL,3,17,12,'Nom_173','<p>Un territoire prosp&egrave;re de l\'extr&ecirc;me orient Kothien o&ugrave; les habitants ont d&eacute;velopp&eacute;s leur propre culture assez diff&eacute;rente du reste du pays et tr&egrave;s ax&eacute; sur le culte d\'Ishtar comme d&eacute;esse unique. Il a &eacute;t&eacute; annex&eacute; par Khoraja et ses mercenaires sh&eacute;mites qui ont d&eacute;truit les murailles pour mettre &agrave; genoux les arm&eacute;es kothiennes.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[89.90625,-79.703125],[89.734375,-80.265625],[89.578125,-80.734375],[89.40625,-81.1875],[89.21875,-81.734375],[89.03125,-82.140625],[88.734375,-82.453125],[88.5,-82.796875],[88.25,-82.96875],[88.046875,-83.390625],[88,-83.890625],[88.109375,-84.421875],[88.390625,-84.75],[88.6875,-85.21875],[88.859375,-85.765625],[89.03125,-86.265625],[89.03125,-86.71875],[88.890625,-87.203125],[88.671875,-87.515625],[88.375,-87.828125],[88.140625,-88.109375],[87.8125,-88.34375],[87.53125,-88.578125],[87.34375,-88.921875],[87.71875,-89.25],[87.96875,-89.453125],[88.3125,-89.640625],[88.875,-89.484375],[89.140625,-89.296875],[89.25,-88.921875],[89.375,-88.5625],[89.71875,-88.359375],[90.234375,-88.15625],[90.640625,-88.078125],[91.03125,-88.078125],[91.421875,-88.25],[91.78125,-88.421875],[92.265625,-88.59375],[92.765625,-88.5625],[93.1875,-88.515625],[93.40625,-88.625],[93.578125,-88.375],[93.796875,-88.109375],[93.625,-87.8125],[93.390625,-87.546875],[93.171875,-87.21875],[93,-86.84375],[92.875,-86.4375],[92.890625,-86],[92.859375,-85.59375],[92.84375,-85.328125],[92.859375,-85.03125],[93.203125,-84.984375],[93.59375,-84.859375],[93.96875,-84.765625],[94.3125,-84.421875],[94.546875,-84.09375],[94.875,-83.703125],[95.296875,-83.40625],[95.4375,-83.09375],[95.578125,-82.671875],[95.71875,-82.34375],[95.796875,-81.9375],[95.9375,-81.46875],[96.125,-81.078125],[96.28125,-80.734375],[95.921875,-80.515625],[95.65625,-80.28125],[95.25,-80.125],[94.8125,-79.953125],[94.46875,-79.84375],[94.140625,-79.6875],[93.90625,-79.640625],[93.5,-79.765625],[93.109375,-79.90625],[92.859375,-79.859375],[92.59375,-79.65625],[92.40625,-79.484375],[92.109375,-79.28125],[91.796875,-79.375],[91.546875,-79.5625],[91.09375,-79.78125],[90.578125,-79.875],[90.25,-79.78125],[89.90625,-79.703125]]]}}','#bdffaf',7,15,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL),(174,443,NULL,18,12,12,'Nom_174','<p>Anuphar &eacute;tait la plus grande cit&eacute;e marchande de Corinthie, basant sa politique sur l\'ouverture culturelle et le commerce du fait de sa fronti&egrave;re avec le royaume de Koth. Mais ce dernier d&eacute;cida de s\'emparer du fief qui tomba dans leurs mains. Les habitants d\'Anuphar r&eacute;sist&egrave;rent peu &agrave; ce changement de tutelle, surtout que l\'occupant &eacute;tait plut&ocirc;t tol&eacute;rant et que la cohabitation se passait bien. Toutefois les autres Corinthiens avaient d&eacute;cid&eacute; de reprendre co&ucirc;te que co&ucirc;te le fief, faisant d\'Anuphar un avant-poste kothien perp&eacute;tuellement en guerre, les cit&eacute;es corinthiennes tentant toujours de la r&eacute;cup&eacute;rer, au prix du sang, malgr&eacute; les ann&eacute;es. De fait les campagnes d\'Anuphar furent tr&egrave;s endommag&eacute;es et perdirent leur splendeur de jadis.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Puis Goros, Archonte-Roi de Khumar usa de diplomatie avec la Reine Kalishar afin d\'obtenir un statut particulier pour Anuphar qui d&eacute;sormais serait dirig&eacute; par Aspasia (Corinthienne) et Korrak (Kothien), un fief ind&eacute;pendant mais sous protectorat commun de la Corinthie du Nord et de Koth.</p>\r\n<p>Depuis peu, le fief fait partie int&eacute;grante de l\'empire d\'Enosis.</p>',NULL,NULL,'Aspasia et Korrak',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[83,-76.625],[83.03125,-76.3125],[83.296875,-76.203125],[83.671875,-76.25],[83.96875,-76.21875],[84.34375,-75.953125],[84.65625,-75.796875],[84.875,-75.703125],[85.328125,-75.78125],[85.75,-75.859375],[86.140625,-75.984375],[86.5625,-75.890625],[87.15625,-75.84375],[87.703125,-75.84375],[88.234375,-75.765625],[88.703125,-75.78125],[89.21875,-75.78125],[89.625,-75.84375],[90.140625,-75.953125],[90.5625,-75.96875],[91.0625,-75.890625],[91.734375,-75.75],[92.171875,-75.625],[92.65625,-75.421875],[92.9375,-75.28125],[93.28125,-75.5625],[93.546875,-75.953125],[93.921875,-76.3125],[94.171875,-76.640625],[94.375,-76.8125],[93.875,-76.921875],[93.390625,-77.078125],[92.9375,-77.140625],[92.828125,-77.4375],[93.109375,-77.75],[93.265625,-78.1875],[93.078125,-78.40625],[92.671875,-78.421875],[92.296875,-78.515625],[92.09375,-78.765625],[92.15625,-79.171875],[91.84375,-79.453125],[91.328125,-79.65625],[90.90625,-79.828125],[90.359375,-79.828125],[89.9375,-79.6875],[89.515625,-79.8125],[89.0625,-79.84375],[88.671875,-79.65625],[88.25,-79.578125],[87.734375,-79.71875],[87.359375,-79.890625],[86.96875,-80.078125],[86.71875,-80.03125],[86.59375,-79.625],[86.359375,-79.34375],[86.078125,-79.15625],[85.703125,-78.953125],[85.359375,-78.703125],[85.09375,-78.46875],[84.859375,-78.390625],[84.5625,-78.578125],[84.15625,-78.71875],[83.828125,-78.703125],[83.671875,-78.375],[83.734375,-77.9375],[83.625,-77.65625],[83.375,-77.421875],[83.1875,-77.078125],[83,-76.625]]]}}','#ffdac9',9,20,2,NULL,NULL,'instable',NULL,2,NULL),(175,78,NULL,3,17,12,'Nom_175','<p>Ce fief de Khauran vivait dans une atmosph&egrave;re paisible jusqu\'&agrave; ce qu\'il soit d&eacute;vast&eacute; par les cr&eacute;atures de Dagoth. Il a &eacute;t&eacute; pris r&eacute;cemment sans gu&egrave;re d\'opposition par Zamora.</p>','Kessa',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[96.453125,-80.671875],[96.9375,-80.828125],[97.40625,-81.203125],[97.984375,-81.59375],[98.4375,-82.03125],[98.9375,-82.515625],[99.296875,-82.9375],[99.59375,-83.328125],[99.75,-83.734375],[100.046875,-83.59375],[100.453125,-83.171875],[100.84375,-82.921875],[101.421875,-82.890625],[102.015625,-82.53125],[102.171875,-82.109375],[102.4375,-81.671875],[102.796875,-81.140625],[103.171875,-80.625],[103.4375,-80.078125],[103.59375,-79.65625],[103.734375,-79.140625],[103.75,-78.515625],[103.3125,-78.609375],[102.90625,-78.65625],[102.546875,-78.53125],[102.171875,-78.40625],[101.734375,-78.671875],[101.34375,-79.1875],[100.96875,-79.375],[100.296875,-79.75],[99.765625,-80.046875],[99.296875,-80.359375],[98.171875,-80.5],[97.296875,-80.546875],[96.765625,-80.640625],[96.453125,-80.671875]]]}}','#c9f989',135,15,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,NULL),(176,78,NULL,3,17,12,'Nom_176','<p>Capitale du Royaume de Khauran, cette zone r&eacute;put&eacute; paisible et riche fut en 1301 le lieu de nombreux &eacute;v&eacute;nements qui men&egrave;rent &agrave; l\'invasion de ce petit fief par des cr&eacute;atures monstrueuses qui se trouve d&eacute;sormais dirig&eacute; par une &eacute;trange th&eacute;ocratie Dagonite.</p>\r\n<p>Les r&eacute;cits d\'horreurs abondent depuis. On parle de sacrifices humains, de charniers et d\'accouplements entre des humains et des cr&eacute;ature monstrueuses et semi-aquatiques autour des lacs de montagne.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>H&eacute;las la route des Rois serpente en plein au milieu de ces sc&egrave;nes immondes et dangereuses, aussi les caravanes ont d&eacute;sormais deux choix qui s\'offrent &agrave; eux. Soit ils &eacute;vitent Khauran en passant directement de Korvesh &agrave; Shadizar via une passe petite et impraticable la moiti&eacute; de l\'ann&eacute;e &agrave; cause des neiges. Soit ils prennent le m&ecirc;me chemin qu\'avant mais se ruinent en escortes de mercenaires pour pouvoir traverser sans risque.</p>','Kandala',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[96.21875,-80.75],[96.015625,-81.28125],[95.84375,-81.78125],[95.71875,-82.40625],[95.53125,-83.015625],[95.28125,-83.53125],[94.90625,-83.875],[94.546875,-84.21875],[94.296875,-84.5],[93.96875,-84.875],[93.375,-84.953125],[92.90625,-85.046875],[92.703125,-85.0625],[92.90625,-85.40625],[93.34375,-85.59375],[93.625,-85.828125],[93.796875,-86.296875],[93.90625,-86.609375],[94.296875,-86.75],[94.578125,-87.03125],[94.890625,-87.15625],[95.28125,-87.265625],[95.515625,-87.484375],[95.84375,-87.5],[96.234375,-87.625],[96.6875,-87.46875],[97.03125,-87.171875],[97.421875,-86.90625],[97.796875,-86.84375],[98.21875,-86.6875],[98.578125,-86.296875],[98.6875,-85.734375],[98.828125,-85.28125],[99,-84.84375],[99.453125,-84.578125],[99.671875,-84.15625],[99.5625,-83.328125],[99.390625,-82.921875],[98.90625,-82.515625],[98.34375,-81.9375],[97.984375,-81.609375],[97.5625,-81.328125],[97.109375,-81.03125],[96.703125,-80.828125],[96.21875,-80.75]]]}}','#f7afc5',135,20,3,NULL,NULL,'stable',NULL,2,NULL),(177,385,NULL,25,37,NULL,'Nom_177','<p dir=\"ltr\">Surnomm&eacute; la &laquo;&nbsp;D&eacute;solation Rouge&nbsp;&raquo;, le d&eacute;sert de l\'Est est une vaste &eacute;tendue aride, travers&eacute;e d\'est en ouest par la Route des Rois. Constituant la plus grande satrapie du Turan, d\'innombrables routes caravani&egrave;res sillonnent ce d&eacute;sert inhospitalier. C\'est &agrave; l\'oasis d\'Akrel, situ&eacute;e dans le d&eacute;sert de l\'Est, que Conan dissimula les rebelles Khaurani. Une r&eacute;gion connue sous le nom de Makan-e-Mordan (&laquo;&nbsp;l\'endroit aux spectres&nbsp;&raquo;), situ&eacute;e dans les confins int&eacute;rieurs du d&eacute;sert, est r&eacute;put&eacute; hant&eacute;e. On y trouverait de grands bassins dans lesquels les lotus pousseraient en quantit&eacute;...</p>\r\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7903ed6a-ab77-7b2b-6f85-7552dfeaea42\"> Le satrape est bas&eacute; au fort Wakla, situ&eacute; &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la Route des Rois, proche de la fronti&egrave;res des steppes Kozakis. B&acirc;ti pr&egrave;s de plusieurs oasis fortifi&eacute;es par un long mur d\'enceinte, le fort Wakla est peu &agrave; peu devenu un point de passage oblig&eacute; pour les caravanes en qu&ecirc;tes d\'eau et de repos. Il dispose m&ecirc;me d\'un souk r&eacute;put&eacute; pour voir transiter de nombreux tr&eacute;sors revendus par les pilleurs nomades. &Agrave; l\'extr&ecirc;me sud-est se trouvent les ruines de l\'antique cit&eacute; d\'Alhmet, r&eacute;duite en cendre il y a plusieurs si&egrave;cle pour avoir refus&eacute; de payer ses taxes pendant plus de deux ans.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[92.875,-85.4375],[92.890625,-86.015625],[93,-86.9375],[93.234375,-87.453125],[93.5625,-87.859375],[93.75,-88.21875],[93.453125,-88.515625],[93.421875,-89.03125],[93.703125,-89.453125],[94.5625,-89.734375],[95.15625,-90.078125],[95.765625,-90.5],[95.9375,-91.078125],[95.984375,-91.671875],[95.953125,-92.4375],[96.53125,-92.140625],[97.109375,-92.203125],[97.421875,-92.640625],[97.5625,-93.203125],[98.109375,-93.25],[98.59375,-93.40625],[99.078125,-93.734375],[99.421875,-94.203125],[99.515625,-94.671875],[99.53125,-95.09375],[99.921875,-95.65625],[100.328125,-96.421875],[100.5625,-96.84375],[101.03125,-97.296875],[101.25,-97.953125],[101.25,-98.75],[101.203125,-99.5],[100.859375,-99.796875],[100.328125,-100.15625],[100.1875,-100.53125],[100.28125,-101.0625],[100.328125,-101.703125],[100.328125,-102.171875],[100.15625,-102.