u. L\'imp&eacute;ratrice est issue des rangs des Zun Tian.&nbsp;<br /><br /><br /></p>','Shu-Chen',NULL,'Falun Zun Tian',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[210.03125,-52.375],[210.03125,-51.59375],[210.375,-50.75],[210.625,-49.9375],[210.84375,-49.1875],[211.375,-48.3125],[212,-47.3125],[212.90625,-46.5625],[213.59375,-45.65625],[213.859375,-44.96875],[214.03125,-43.8125],[214.03125,-42.78125],[214.03125,-41.6875],[214.0625,-40.96875],[214.875,-41.3125],[215.71875,-41.625],[216.84375,-41.90625],[217.84375,-42.03125],[218.75,-41.8125],[219.59375,-41.625],[220.71875,-41.875],[221.90625,-42.09375],[222.78125,-42.1875],[223.53125,-41.8125],[224.46875,-41.65625],[225.71875,-41.90625],[226.4375,-42.8125],[226.375,-43.78125],[226.53125,-45.25],[226.375,-46.65625],[226.375,-47.71875],[226.46875,-48.5],[225.8125,-49.25],[224.96875,-49.71875],[224.6875,-50.1875],[225.125,-50.46875],[225.34375,-50.375],[225.40625,-50.84375],[225.6875,-51.4375],[226.0625,-51.75],[226.09375,-52.40625],[225.96875,-52.90625],[225.53125,-53.28125],[225.375,-53.84375],[225.5625,-54.625],[225.6875,-55.40625],[225.96875,-55.96875],[226.46875,-56.5625],[226.96875,-57.15625],[227.21875,-57.78125],[226.78125,-57.96875],[226.375,-58.3125],[226.46875,-59.03125],[226.375,-59.78125],[226.0625,-60.46875],[225.96875,-61.1875],[225.875,-61.84375],[225.3125,-61.8125],[224.4375,-61.78125],[223.71875,-61.84375],[222.8125,-62.15625],[222.3125,-62.375],[221.46875,-62.03125],[220.5625,-61.6875],[220.15625,-61.15625],[220.09375,-60.1875],[219.6875,-59.625],[219.03125,-59.25],[218.71875,-58.65625],[219.125,-58.15625],[219.375,-57.65625],[219.28125,-57],[218.71875,-56.53125],[217.84375,-56.15625],[216.78125,-56.09375],[215.84375,-55.96875],[214.84375,-55.90625],[213.9375,-55.9375],[212.875,-55.84375],[212.03125,-55.3125],[211.5,-54.75],[211.15625,-54.09375],[211.03125,-53.625],[210.5,-53.25],[210.03125,-53.03125],[210.03125,-52.375]]]}}','#a5ffd9',56,20,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,NULL),(203,427,NULL,17,4,NULL,'Nom_203','<p>On trouve ici de riches plaines et des for&ecirc;ts verdoyantes ainsi que de nombreuses cit&eacute;s.<br /><br />La famille Qin Pao qui dirige cette province a connu de nombreux d&eacute;boires &agrave; la cour ces derni&egrave;res ann&eacute;es ce qui lui ont valu une perte importante d\'influence aupr&egrave;s de l\'empereur.&nbsp;</p>','Shaulum',NULL,'Falun Qin Pao',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[200.46875,-63.375],[200.46875,-64.53125],[200.46875,-65.75],[200.625,-67.5625],[200.8125,-68.9375],[201.09375,-69.9375],[201.6875,-70.875],[202.25,-71.5625],[203.40625,-71.96875],[204.53125,-72.3125],[205.71875,-72.46875],[206.78125,-72.4375],[207.6875,-72.28125],[208.90625,-71.65625],[208.65625,-70.875],[208.65625,-70.03125],[208.71875,-69.125],[208.53125,-68.40625],[208.21875,-67.6875],[207.84375,-66.84375],[207.65625,-66.3125],[207.78125,-65.28125],[208.03125,-64.21875],[208.375,-63.09375],[208.71875,-61.84375],[209.1875,-60.65625],[209.46875,-59.96875],[209.875,-59.65625],[210.625,-59.8125],[211.15625,-60.25],[212,-60.59375],[212.90625,-60.6875],[214.03125,-60.65625],[214.96875,-60.1875],[215.75,-59.75],[216.65625,-59.21875],[217.4375,-58.75],[218.03125,-58.59375],[218.75,-58.9375],[219.03125,-58.34375],[219.46875,-57.8125],[219.5625,-57.21875],[219.125,-56.84375],[218.59375,-56.4375],[217.90625,-56.1875],[217.09375,-56.1875],[216.03125,-56.09375],[215.03125,-55.90625],[214.125,-55.90625],[213.15625,-55.8125],[212.0625,-55.3125],[211.53125,-54.8125],[211.21875,-54.25],[211,-53.65625],[210.53125,-53.3125],[210.09375,-52.96875],[209.78125,-52.21875],[208.8125,-52.15625],[207.8125,-52.21875],[206.875,-52.1875],[206.25,-52.1875],[205.65625,-52.59375],[204.9375,-53.28125],[204.34375,-53.84375],[203.6875,-54.3125],[202.96875,-54.78125],[202.25,-55.1875],[201.375,-55.90625],[200.96875,-56.09375],[200.75,-57.1875],[200.78125,-58.25],[200.75,-59.40625],[200.8125,-60.71875],[200.625,-61.78125],[200.5,-62.8125],[200.46875,-63.375]]]}}','#afffc8',56,20,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,NULL),(204,427,NULL,2,4,NULL,'Nom_204','<p>Tant par leur placement &agrave; l\'intersection des routes commerciales Khitanes, la cl&eacute;mence du climat et le faste des villes et places fortes qui s\'y sont multipli&eacute;es, les terres imp&eacute;riales sont le joyaux de l\'empire Khitan. V&eacute;ritable c&oelig;ur de l\'administration imp&eacute;riale, sa puissance rayonne jusque dans les plus sombres recoins des terres &agrave; l\'est du grand mur. En son c&oelig;ur, Paikang, la cit&eacute; imp&eacute;riale, joyau parmi les joyaux, est la demeure immuable de l\'empereur Dieu.<br /><br />L\'enchev&egrave;trement des familles, fonctions imp&eacute;riales, guildes et sectes est inextricable. Seul un v&eacute;ritable Khitan peut esp&eacute;rer en comprendre les rouages.</p>','Paikang, la cité impériale','Empire','Empereur-Dieu Yah-Chieng',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[213.53125,-78.25],[214.65625,-77.71875],[215.1875,-77.1875],[215.53125,-76.40625],[216.0625,-75.90625],[216.875,-75.53125],[217.3125,-76.09375],[217.71875,-76.53125],[217.9375,-75.8125],[218.28125,-75.375],[218.875,-75.53125],[219.25,-75.84375],[219.75,-75.71875],[220.21875,-75.3125],[220.5625,-74.96875],[221.40625,-74.9375],[222.28125,-74.84375],[222.84375,-74.84375],[223.3125,-74.5625],[223.8125,-73.875],[224.15625,-73.40625],[224.5,-72.8125],[224.09375,-72.40625],[223.6875,-72],[224.125,-71.6875],[224.9375,-71.65625],[225.5,-71.1875],[225.875,-70.625],[225.6875,-70.21875],[225.6875,-69.59375],[226.375,-69.1875],[227,-68.75],[226.96875,-68.09375],[226.59375,-67.46875],[226.53125,-66.59375],[226.59375,-65.90625],[227.03125,-65.75],[22