59.359375,-88.515625],[59,-88.03125],[58.53125,-87.78125],[58.078125,-87.515625],[57.765625,-87.140625],[57.265625,-86.890625],[56.390625,-86.78125],[55.65625,-86.640625],[54.953125,-86.546875],[54.5,-86.46875],[54.359375,-85.96875],[54.359375,-85.453125],[53.9375,-85.234375],[53.515625,-85.140625],[53.09375,-85.40625],[52.625,-85.671875],[52.1875,-85.9375],[51.828125,-86.328125],[51.421875,-86.734375],[50.875,-86.828125],[50.15625,-86.859375],[49.71875,-86.765625],[49.390625,-86.671875]]]}}','#c9deff',6,15,1,NULL,NULL,'instable',NULL,2,NULL),(219,373,NULL,2,3,24,'Nom_219','<p>Une toundra froide au climat inhospitalier. Le centre de population le plus important est Rhamdam : une ville de yourtes construite autour d&rsquo;une idole de pierre. La r&eacute;gion est pass&eacute;e sous le contr&ocirc;le d&rsquo;envahisseurs barbares venus du Roskau &agrave; l&rsquo;ouest, apr&egrave;s plusieurs ann&eacute;es de lutte acharn&eacute;e contre les nomades hyrkaniens, puis contre des bandes de maraudeurs venus du sud.</p>','Rhamdam',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[145.046875,-21.71875],[145.765625,-21.359375],[146.484375,-21.15625],[147.15625,-21.234375],[147.890625,-21.28125],[148.71875,-21.21875],[149.34375,-20.78125],[150.09375,-20.359375],[150.609375,-19.96875],[151.953125,-19.1875],[152.828125,-18.546875],[153.125,-18.4375],[153.140625,-19.046875],[153.171875,-20.40625],[153.171875,-21.265625],[153.03125,-21.875],[153.015625,-22.625],[153,-23.5],[153.296875,-24.234375],[153.609375,-24.71875],[153.78125,-25.34375],[153.78125,-25.921875],[153.90625,-26.625],[153.890625,-27.1875],[153.296875,-27.484375],[152.75,-27.78125],[152.296875,-28.25],[152.09375,-28.734375],[151.390625,-29.203125],[150.734375,-29.53125],[150.609375,-29.890625],[150,-29.953125],[149.484375,-30.15625],[149.375,-30.765625],[149.078125,-31.125],[148.75,-31.59375],[148.171875,-32],[147.6875,-32.3125],[147.15625,-32.59375],[146.53125,-32.8125],[145.96875,-33.25],[145.515625,-33.328125],[145.3125,-32.9375],[145.375,-32.578125],[145.46875,-32.21875],[145.171875,-32.046875],[144.859375,-32.046875],[144.421875,-32.125],[143.921875,-32.03125],[143.734375,-31.75],[143.546875,-31.265625],[143.359375,-30.890625],[143.21875,-30.484375],[143.296875,-30.375],[143.546875,-30.46875],[143.90625,-30.34375],[144.109375,-30.125],[144.34375,-29.859375],[144.125,-29.59375],[143.75,-29.484375],[143.4375,-29.3125],[143.359375,-28.96875],[143.46875,-28.6875],[143.40625,-28.421875],[143.109375,-28.171875],[143.0625,-27.984375],[142.984375,-27.46875],[143.171875,-26.875],[143.15625,-26.3125],[143.0625,-25.796875],[143.0625,-25.328125],[143.078125,-24.953125],[143.296875,-24.765625],[143.71875,-24.65625],[144.09375,-24.515625],[144.453125,-24.34375],[144.359375,-23.875],[144.40625,-23.53125],[144.625,-23.21875],[144.8125,-22.859375],[144.84375,-22.515625],[144.640625,-22.1875],[144.640625,-21.921875],[145.046875,-21.71875]]]}}','#fcbffc',106,10,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL),(220,395,NULL,2,3,24,'Nom_220','<p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Au nord des cit&eacute;s portuaires, la c&ocirc;te se transforme en un labyrinthe d&rsquo;estuaires, de bancs de sable, et de langues d&rsquo;herbes d&eacute;tremp&eacute;es sans aucun signe d&rsquo;habitation humaine. C&rsquo;est quelque part ici qu&rsquo;est suppos&eacute;e se trouver Onagrul, la ville secr&egrave;te des pirates dont l&rsquo;emplacement exact reste un myst&egrave;re. A l&rsquo;int&eacute;rieur des terres s&rsquo;&eacute;tend le pays de Zarfhaana, une grande steppe qui a surv&eacute;cu aux cataclysmes d&rsquo;antan et dont les hyrkaniens seraient originaires. Les clans nomades qui y vivent sont particuli&egrave;rement hostiles aux &eacute;trangers.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><br /><br /></p>','Attar Karapesk','Khanat (fédération tribale)','Oshmaan Khan',NULL,'Bannière du Loup Blanc','Barbare nomade','Hyrkanien au sang pu