ses routes de caravanes qui les parcourent, mais doivent r&eacute;guli&egrave;rement payer des tributs aux clans nomades pour &eacute;viter d&rsquo;&ecirc;tre pill&eacute;es. Au sud, la cit&eacute; fortifi&eacute;e turannienne de Secundaram prot&egrave;ge ces routes contre les incursions venues du Ghulistan.</p>','Secundaram',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[161.40625,-36.359375],[161.546875,-36.703125],[161.71875,-37.125],[161.875,-37.453125],[162.03125,-37.953125],[162.203125,-38.5],[162.40625,-38.890625],[162.640625,-39.421875],[162.921875,-39.9375],[163.265625,-40.609375],[163.625,-41.171875],[164.078125,-41.78125],[164.484375,-42.3125],[165.078125,-43.03125],[165.703125,-43.59375],[166.1875,-44.078125],[166.796875,-44.6875],[167.203125,-44.984375],[167.609375,-45.375],[167.96875,-45.703125],[168.453125,-45.96875],[168.859375,-46.234375],[169.546875,-46.6875],[170.078125,-46.90625],[170.78125,-47.296875],[171.359375,-47.625],[171.859375,-48],[172.203125,-48.359375],[172.609375,-49.015625],[172.9375,-49.453125],[173.5,-49.5625],[174.109375,-49.640625],[174.78125,-49.71875],[175.53125,-49.921875],[175.78125,-50],[175.625,-50.359375],[175.46875,-50.59375],[175.40625,-51.015625],[175.390625,-51.1875],[175.546875,-51.515625],[175.65625,-51.75],[175.765625,-51.96875],[175.953125,-52.40625],[176.125,-52.796875],[176.203125,-53.109375],[176.296875,-53.3125],[176.421875,-53.734375],[176.53125,-53.984375],[176.515625,-54.34375],[176.4375,-54.734375],[176.28125,-54.9375],[176.09375,-55.3125],[175.96875,-55.578125],[175.78125,-55.78125],[175.65625,-55.984375],[175.5625,-56.234375],[175.46875,-56.390625],[175.734375,-56.796875],[175.9375,-57.171875],[176.0625,-57.328125],[176.3125,-57.71875],[176.5,-57.90625],[177.125,-57.96875],[177.546875,-58.0625],[178.015625,-58.046875],[178.359375,-58.03125],[178.65625,-58.09375],[178.8125,-58.375],[179.03