 de cit&eacute;s ras&eacute;es par Turan pendant les guerres du Tarim. La plus embl&eacute;matique de celles-ci &eacute;tait Makkalet, v&eacute;ritable joyau de la c&ocirc;te est qui ne s&rsquo;est jamais remise de la destruction apport&eacute;e par les arm&eacute;es du prince Yezdigerd. Les populations s&eacute;dentaires vivent principalement de p&ecirc;che ainsi que de la chasse aux morses et aux narvals, dont ils exploitent la viande et l&rsquo;ivoire.</p>\r\n<p>Les Maraudeurs en prennent possession par la force et dirigent le fief depuis.</p>','Makkalet',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[144.953125,-45.671875],[145.15625,-45.671875],[145.328125,-45.671875],[145.546875,-45.671875],[145.75,-45.6875],[145.9375,-45.6875],[146.28125,-45.6875],[146.59375,-45.65625],[146.765625,-45.65625],[147.15625,-45.671875],[147.359375,-45.671875],[147.5625,-45.671875],[147.875,-45.671875],[148.140625,-45.671875],[148.28125,-45.671875],[148.65625,-45.640625],[148.90625,-45.65625],[149.09375,-45.6875],[149.328125,-45.703125],[149.5,-45.703125],[149.484375,-45.890625],[149.390625,-46.03125],[149.359375,-46.203125],[149.359375,-46.328125],[149.359375,-46.515625],[149.296875,-46.71875],[149.296875,-46.90625],[149.28125,-47.125],[149.28125,-47.390625],[149.296875,-47.546875],[149.375,-47.765625],[149.453125,-48.015625],[149.515625,-48.1875],[149.5625,-48.40625],[149.65625,-48.734375],[149.75,-48.96875],[149.84375,-49.28125],[149.953125,-49.46875],[150.125,-49.6875],[150.3125,-49.859375],[150.5625,-50.046875],[150.78125,-50.25],[151.078125,-50.5625],[151.390625,-50.828125],[151.625,-51.03125],[151.8125,-51.140625],[152.015625,-51.359375],[152.234375,-51.578125],[152.4375,-51.765625],[152.671875,-51.96875],[152.953125,-52.234375],[153.21875,-52.40625],[153.609375,-52.6875],[153.890625,-52.96875],[154.265625,-53.234375],[154.65625,-53.53125],[155.09375,-53.906