 l&rsquo;Hyrkanie. Elle est domin&eacute;e par la cit&eacute; de Khoraf qui a pendant longtemps &eacute;t&eacute; une alli&eacute;e importante de Turan, ce qui lui a assur&eacute; richesse et prosp&eacute;rit&eacute;. Pour autant, le puissant empire est rest&eacute; sourd &agrave; ses appels &agrave; l&rsquo;aide lorsque les bandes guerri&egrave;res de la Maraude ont d&eacute;ferl&eacute; sur ses murs en 1311. Depuis, la ville peine &agrave; se remettre du traumatisme de sa mise &agrave; sac, et de l&rsquo;occupation qu&rsquo;elle subit par ses nouveaux ma&icirc;tres.&nbsp;</span></p>','Khoraf',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[146.640625,-64.046875],[146.890625,-64.125],[147.140625,-64.1875],[147.3125,-64.265625],[147.53125,-64.28125],[147.75,-64.390625],[148,-64.4375],[148.171875,-64.4375],[148.453125,-64.4375],[148.71875,-64.4375],[149.171875,-64.515625],[149.453125,-64.59375],[149.859375,-64.59375],[150.1875,-64.65625],[150.484375,-64.703125],[150.6875,-64.796875],[150.84375,-64.921875],[151.046875,-65.046875],[151.171875,-65.15625],[151.390625,-65.296875],[151.5625,-65.375],[151.84375,-65.46875],[152.15625,-65.5],[152.328125,-65.53125],[152.59375,-65.609375],[152.859375,-65.625],[153.15625,-65.65625],[153.46875,-65.6875],[153.75,-65.671875],[154.140625,-65.671875],[154.421875,-65.65625],[154.78125,-65.65625],[155.125,-65.578125],[155.390625,-65.578125],[155.75,-65.46875],[156,-65.421875],[156.25,-65.28125],[156.484375,-65.140625],[156.6875,-65.046875],[156.921875,-65],[157.234375,-64.890625],[157.375,-64.703125],[157.609375,-64.5625],[157.859375,-64.375],[158.046875,-64.234375],[158.25,-64.140625],[158.4375,-63.9375],[158.671875,-63.859375],[158.9375,-63.78125],[159.140625,-63.625],[159.3125,-63.5],[159.625,-63.375],[159.828125,-63.265625],[160.03125,-63.171875],[160.1875,-63.0625],[160.359375,-63.078125],[160.53125,-63.234375],[16