petit massif de faible altitude &agrave; l&rsquo;int&eacute;rieur des terres, qui donnent leur nom &agrave; cette r&eacute;gion. Le climat relativement cl&eacute;ment permet aux habitants de cultiver le sol, mais la v&eacute;ritable richesse r&eacute;side dans les routes commerciales qui sont nombreuses &agrave; traverser ce territoire. La cit&eacute; de Zaporoska, situ&eacute;e &agrave; l&rsquo;embouchure du fleuve du m&ecirc;me nom, a &eacute;t&eacute; tour &agrave; tour sous le contr&ocirc;le de Turan, puis d&rsquo;un khan nomade belliqueux, et &agrave; pr&eacute;sent des sinistres mercenaires de la Maraude.<br /><br /></span></p>','Zaporoska',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[144.71875,-74.484375],[144.921875,-74.609375],[145.125,-74.765625],[145.34375,-74.921875],[145.5,-74.984375],[145.703125,-75.15625],[145.875,-75.234375],[146.15625,-75.28125],[146.453125,-75.40625],[146.84375,-75.453125],[147.140625,-75.46875],[147.65625,-75.515625],[148.015625,-75.515625],[148.25,-75.5625],[148.515625,-75.5625],[148.9375,-75.59375],[149.203125,-75.59375],[149.515625,-75.609375],[149.6875,-75.609375],[150.0625,-75.53125],[150.4375,-75.40625],[150.703125,-75.359375],[150.984375,-75.3125],[151.546875,-75.25],[152.078125,-75.09375],[152.484375,-74.96875],[152.984375,-74.96875],[153.515625,-74.96875],[153.90625,-74.96875],[154.21875,-75.0625],[154.671875,-75.140625],[155.125,-75.171875],[155.40625,-75.1875],[155.859375,-75.21875],[156.296875,-75.3125],[156.671875,-75.421875],[157.125,-75.671875],[157.4375,-75.890625],[157.96875,-76.109375],[158.328125,-76.234375],[158.6875,-76.421875],[159.09375,-76.609375],[159.5,-76.84375],[159.921875,-77.234375],[160.359375,-77.546875],[160.859375,-77.765625],[161.1875,-77.9375],[161.5,-78.09375],[161.828125,-78.21875],[162.09375,-78.3125],[162.578125,-78.53125],[163.015625,-78.734375],[163.34375,-78.875],[163.5