e et rejoignent les montagnes Him&eacute;lia au nord-ouest de Meru, enclavant ainsi ce petit royaume entre les deux massifs. Au sud, le climat est plus hospitalier et la r&eacute;gion est riche en lacs poissonneux. La cit&eacute; marchande de Bukhrosa, c&eacute;l&egrave;bre pour ses encens et ses &eacute;pices, est d&eacute;sormais situ&eacute;e sur la fameuse Route des Empereurs. Le territoire entier est pass&eacute; sous administration du Khita&iuml; depuis une dizaine d&rsquo;ann&eacute;es, en une transition pacifique mais dont les conditions obscures soul&egrave;vent de nombreuses questions. Les habitants, eux, ne semblent pas tous satisfaits de ce changement.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[173.28125,-102.421875],[173.484375,-102.328125],[173.6875,-102.40625],[173.796875,-102.546875],[174.03125,-102.734375],[174.203125,-102.796875],[174.5,-102.90625],[174.640625,-102.90625],[174.984375,-102.875],[175.203125,-102.859375],[175.5,-102.859375],[175.828125,-102.9375],[176.046875,-102.96875],[176.265625,-103.03125],[176.484375,-103.09375],[176.765625,-103.15625],[177,-103.1875],[177.359375,-103.234375],[177.578125,-103.3125],[177.84375,-103.46875],[178,-103.59375],[178.203125,-103.671875],[178.484375,-103.828125],[178.671875,-103.984375],[178.921875,-104.109375],[179.171875,-104.46875],[179.1875,-104.75],[179.25,-105.03125],[179.28125,-105.28125],[179.453125,-105.46875],[179.640625,-105.5625],[179.765625,-105.734375],[179.796875,-106.015625],[179.796875,-106.359375],[179.765625,-106.671875],[179.578125,-106.734375],[179.46875,-106.828125],[179.359375,-107.046875],[179.359375,-107.375],[179.328125,-107.671875],[179.140625,-108.03125],[179,-108.359375],[178.796875,-108.703125],[178.703125,-108.796875],[178.546875,-108.9375],[178.265625,-109.109375],[177.984375,-109.1875],[177.765625,-109.234375],[177.5,-109.3125],[177.234375,-1