an style=\"color: white; mso-themecolor: background1;\">Province la plus recul&eacute;e du Ghulistan, le pays Khirgiz est aussi le plus montagneux. Enfonc&eacute; dans les hauteurs de la cha&icirc;ne him&eacute;lienne, c\'est une terre fr&eacute;quemment secou&eacute;e par les tremblements de terre et les glissements de terrains. Une bonne partie du pays Khirgiz se retrouve sous la neige presque toute l\'ann&eacute;e.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color: white; mso-themecolor: background1;\">Les hommes qui y vivent font partie des plus puissants barbares du Ghulistan. On les nomme les Engereks et leur Krall actuel se nomme Ghumer.</span></p>','Khojua',NULL,'Moshardin','50 000',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Frontalier avec l\'Hyrkanie (nord), Méru (est) et Vendhya (sud).','extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[167.859375,-111.171875],[167.578125,-111.015625],[167.3125,-110.765625],[167.0625,-110.5],[166.890625,-110.171875],[166.671875,-109.875],[166.484375,-109.59375],[166.296875,-109.28125],[166.140625,-109],[165.953125,-108.71875],[165.765625,-108.46875],[165.6875,-108.171875],[165.6875,-107.96875],[165.546875,-107.296875],[165.484375,-106.84375],[165.4375,-106.484375],[165.375,-106.09375],[165.3125,-105.703125],[165.265625,-105.21875],[165.21875,-104.828125],[165.203125,-104.46875],[165.203125,-104.125],[165.171875,-103.796875],[165.15625,-103.421875],[165.171875,-103.109375],[165.28125,-102.71875],[165.390625,-102.390625],[165.5625,-102.109375],[165.703125,-101.765625],[165.875,-101.4375],[166,-101.171875],[166.125,-100.859375],[166.1875,-100.546875],[166.234375,-100.25],[166.25,-100.125],[166.4375,-100.015625],[166.6875,-99.90625],[166.890625,-99.84375],[167.140625,-99.75],[167.421875,-99.75],[167.671875,-99.71875],[167.9375,-99.796875],[168.234375,-99.875],[168.53125,-100.03125],[168.734375,-100.234375],[168.90625,-100.390625],[169.09375,-100.546875],[169.265625,-