a fronti&egrave;re ouest. Il joins au nord les asgards au sud la province de Tauran historiquement Aquilonienne et borde pas moins de trois territoires Pictes. Sur ce fief &agrave; &eacute;t&eacute; &eacute;riger de hautes muraille et des d&eacute;fenses strat&eacute;giques telles que la forteresse d\'Ursica. Des postes de guets et des feux d&rsquo;alarmes ornent le tout. On trouve par endroit des pierres dress&eacute;es en direction des &eacute;toiles et les carri&egrave;res de pierre y sont nombreuses, trahissant la proximit&eacute; avec des montagnes non loin.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><br /><br /></p>','Ursica',NULL,'Varerg le patient',NULL,NULL,'Barbare','Peau claire, il ne bronzent pas beaucoup vus le temps local','Peuples Celtes','Arme à  deux mains','Ce qu\'ils trouvent portent la plus pars du temps sur ceux qu\'ils pillent',NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[50,-33.0625],[48.8125,-34.625],[49.9375,-35.75],[48.3125,-37.875],[48.0625,-39.4375],[48,-43.3125],[47.5625,-45.4375],[46.9375,-46.25],[46.875,-51.0625],[44.96875,-52.25],[44.375,-51.875],[44.625,-50.75],[44.125,-49.5625],[44.609375,-49.078125],[44.25,-47.125],[43.625,-46.625],[42.3125,-43.0625],[41.3125,-42.9375],[41.8125,-41.875],[41.0625,-41],[41.1875,-39.8125],[41.0625,-38.25],[41.125,-37.125],[42,-36.9375],[42.0625,-35.9375],[44.25,-35.0625],[44.4375,-34.375],[44.8125,-34],[44.5,-33],[47.4375,-33.875],[48.8125,-32.5],[50,-33.0625]]]}}','#f2ee7d',48,10,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,2,NULL),(254,50,NULL,6,11,NULL,'Nom_254','<p>Le territoire du clan du nord, les L&eacute;opards des neiges</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[54.78125,-32.90625],[54.234375,-32.8125],[53.703125,-32.765625],[53.484375,-33.40625],[52.921875,-33.71875],[51.734375,-33.875],[51.875,-32.984375],[49.609375,-33.109375],[49.421875,-33.8125],[49.0625,-34.21875],[48.90625,-34.578125],[49.203125,-34.921875],[49.671875,-35.359375],[49.9375,-35.78125],[49.78125,-36],[49.078125,-36.5625],[48.390625,-37.546875],[48.140625,-38.625],[48.015625,-40.078125],[48.046875,-41.5],[47.96875,-43.171875],[47.90625,-44.28125],[47.71875,-45.015625],[47.359375,-45.5625],[47.609375,-45.5625],[48.25,-45.203125],[49.21875,-44.421875],[49.84375,-44.15625],[49.96875,-43.71875],[50.859375,-42.859375],[51.671875,-42.578125],[52.65625,-41.75],[53.3125,-41.203125],[53.65625,-40.734375],[54.296875,-40.625],[55.015625,-40.765625],[55.59375,-41.15625],[56.203125,-41.953125],[56.78125,-42.46875],[57.34375,-42.65625],[57.90625,-42.859375],[58.484375,-42.734375],[59.125,-43.171875],[59.765625,-43.484375],[60.0625,-43.6875],[60.703125,-42.5625],[61.0625,-41.40625],[61.265625,-40.703125],[62.140625,-39.46875],[62.375,-38.984375],[62.65625,-38.25],[63.5,-37.40625],[64,-36.65625],[64.859375,-36.296875],[65.109375,-36.1875],[65.765625,-35.4375],[65.96875,-35.0625],[66.890625,-34.546875],[67.625,-34.390625],[67.8125,-34.3125],[67.40625,-34.0625],[66.734375,-34.015625],[66.109375,-34.234375],[65.671875,-34.375],[65.015625,-34.5625],[64.375,-34.703125],[63.65625,-34.8125],[62.75,-34.6875],[62,-34.5],[61.328125,-34.3125],[60.78125,-34.203125],[60.71875,-34.609375],[60.796875,-35.15625],[60.421875,-35.21875],[59.84375,-35.15625],[59.234375,-35.078125],[58.546875,-35.25],[58.3125,-35.765625],[58.1875,-36.71875],[58.125,-37.265625],[57.546875,-37.75],[56.75,-37.984375],[56.09375,-38],[54.734375,-37.71875],[53.890625,-37.25],[53.671875,-36.765625],[54.03125,-36.234375],[54.390625,-35.6875],[54.84375,-34.671875],[54.828125,-33.96875],[54.8125,-33.25],[54.78125,-32.90625]]]}}','#f7bcff',49,5,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,NULL),(255,50,NULL,6,11,7,'Nom_255','<p>Le territoire du clan du sud, les Lions noirs</p>\r\n<p>On a vu ce clan m&eacute;langer son sang avec d&rsquo;autres peuples, rencontrer des peuples pr&eacute;humains, apprendre &agrave; &eacute;crire et participer &agrave; des rituels magiques&hellip; Ce sont devenus des aventuriers qui ont pendant un temps &eacute;t&eacute; maudits : une d&eacute;cennie enti&egrave;re sans faire d&rsquo;enfants. Le cimm&eacute;rien moyen fera ais&eacute;ment le rapprochement entre ces 2 probl&egrave;mes et en tirera les conclusions qui s&rsquo;imposent : on ne change pas impun&eacute;ment le mode de vie cimm&eacute;rien.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>','Venarium',NULL,'Chien de Crom',NULL,NULL,'Barbare','caucasien mais pas que, la tribu des Lions Noirs à  permis à  des étranger de se métisser sur place.','Celtes gaulois','Arme à  deux mains,',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[47.953125,-45.375],[48.640625,-44.953125],[49.125,-44.625],[49.640625,-44.265625],[49.984375,-43.640625],[50.21875,-43.28125],[50.625,-43.015625],[51.125,-42.796875],[51.84375,-42.515625],[52.3125,-42.15625],[52.6875,-41.703125],[53.203125,-41.328125],[53.5,-40.953125],[53.953125,-40.765625],[54.296875,-40.6875],[54.828125,-40.796875],[55.328125,-40.9375],[55.640625,-41.328125],[55.890625,-41.875],[56.421875,-42.25],[56.9375,-42.53125],[57.453125,-42.765625],[58.046875,-42.78125],[58.4375,-42.8125],[58.921875,-43.03125],[59.359375,-43.34375],[59.796875,-43.640625],[60.015625,-43.796875],[59.65625,-44.296875],[59.40625,-44.828125],[59.453125,-45.4375],[59.5,-46.03125],[59.5,-46.75],[59.484375,-47.640625],[59.53125,-48.5],[59.546875,-49.109375],[59.578125,-49.6875],[59.75,-50.265625],[59.765625,-50.765625],[59.6875,-51.1875],[59.71875,-51.953125],[59.21875,-52.046875],[58.65625,-52.078125],[58,-51.9375],[57.65625,-51.875],[57.296875,-51.546875],[56.71875,-51.109375],[56.359375,-50.84375],[55.765625,-50.78125],[55.21875,-50.765625],[54.765625,-50.921875],[54.375,-51.3125],[53.9375,-51.5],[53.453125,-51.640625],[53.109375,-51.6875],[52.640625,-51.6875],[52.0625,-51.578125],[51.5,-51.5],[50.859375,-51.5],[50.15625,-51.