s for&ecirc;ts et les prairies alentour. Plus ou moins grands, ces c&ocirc;nes herbus se retrouve de loin en loin sur tout le territoire de la province. Nul ne connait vraiment leur origine, mais la l&eacute;gende dit qu\'ils seraient les tombes d\'antiques h&eacute;ros, enterr&eacute;s avec leurs masques de guerre.&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div style=\"color: #222222; font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\">La r&eacute;gion, bien qu\'active dans le commerce fluvial et l\'&eacute;levage, reste toutefois tr&egrave;s attach&eacute;e &agrave; son identit&eacute; religieuse, et la nomination &agrave; sa t&ecirc;te d\'une pr&ecirc;tresse de Wiccana a &eacute;t&eacute; bien accueillie par une population encline &agrave; la superstition.</div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>','Yarvash',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[90.78125,-47.9375],[90.671875,-48.546875],[90.65625,-49.125],[90.640625,-49.6875],[90.265625,-50.125],[90.078125,-50.578125],[89.75,-50.96875],[89.5,-51.265625],[89.109375,-51.59375],[88.796875,-51.890625],[88.515625,-52.25],[88.0625,-52.46875],[87.609375,-52.625],[87.015625,-52.921875],[87.15625,-53.328125],[87.453125,-53.78125],[87.78125,-54.046875],[88.296875,-54.171875],[88.75,-54.171875],[89.125,-54.34375],[89.6875,-54.59375],[90.09375,-54.90625],[90.671875,-55.390625],[91.03125,-55.734375],[91.625,-55.4375],[91.921875,-54.96875],[92.1875,-54.59375],[92.8125,-54.171875],[93.15625,-53.671875],[93.53125,-53.28125],[94.015625,-52.953125],[94.8125,-52.625],[95.296875,-52.546875],[95.765625,-52.328125],[96.09375,-51.90625],[96.421875,-51.34375],[96.515625,-50.75],[96.40625,-50.25],[96.125,-49.6875],[95.765625,-49.359375],[95.21875,-49.109375],[94.796875,-48.859375],[94.265625,-48.71875],[93.5,-48.65625],[92.84375,-48.515625],[92.46875,-48.234375],[91.953125,-47.875],[91.546875,-47.703125],[90.984375,-47.671875],[90.78125,-47.9375]]]}}','#f986ab',63,15,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,NULL),(274,379,NULL,17,13,15,'Nom_274','<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-86ffd8f1-7fff-fbd3-b651-bb874284fc84\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Une province aujourd\'hui d&eacute;sertique qui a connu son apog&eacute;e pendant la p&eacute;riode faste de la </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Stygie Archa&iuml;que,</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> alors que la tribu </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Qizilbash </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">&eacute;tait au pouvoir. Mais l\'essor de </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Khajar</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> a &eacute;t&eacute; min&eacute; par les rivalit&eacute;s avec la tribu </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Zand</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">. Sa capitale mythique, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Khajar</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">, b&acirc;tie au pied des monts Elbourz a connu le m&ecirc;me destin que </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Sepermeru</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">, engloutie par le sable lors de la </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Grande Temp&ecirc;te</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">. </span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[64.75,-109.88541650772095],[64.90625,-108.57291650772095],[65.9375,-107.94791650772095],[66.625,-108.94791650772095],[68.46875,-109.44791650772095],[71.125,-108.85416650772095],[73.5,-109.94791650772095],[73.65625,-110.88541650772095],[71.5,-116.69791650772095],[71.09375,-116.22916650772095],[69.3125,-116.29166650772095],[67.75,-115.38541650772095],[67.4375,-113.10416650772095],[67.09375,-112.51041650772095],[66,-112.19791650772095],[66.15625,-110.76041650772095],[64.75,-109.88541650772095]]]}}','#889af7',19,15,3,NULL,NULL,'instable',NULL,1,NULL),(275,424,NULL,3,10,NULL,'Nom_275','<div>Comme son nom l\'indique, la r&eacute;gion couvre l\'essentiel de la fronti&egrave;re avec la N&eacute;m&eacute;die. Si de longues guerres ont oppos&eacute; les deux pays par le pass&eacute;, une p&eacute;riode de paix semble s\'&ecirc;tre install&eacute;e qui favorise les &eacute;changes commerciaux et enrichit les Marches. De fronti&egrave;re naturelle, le Fleuve Jaune est devenu aujourd\'hui un axe de communication lucratif dont la noblesse locale a su tirer profit. Comme partout en&nbsp;Brythunie, le pouvoir est aux mains d\'une noblesse latifundiaire, mais les guildes de nautoniers, avec en t&ecirc;te celle de la capitale Potrabia, y jouissent aussi d\'une forte influence.</div>\r\n<div>La province se distingue de ses voisines par son h&eacute;ritage militaire. Le voyageur remarquera que les villes y sont plus fortifi&eacute;es, et les for&ecirc;ts moins vaste qu\'ailleurs dans le pays. Et s\'il s\'aventure &agrave; sonder le c&oelig;ur de ses habitants, il les trouvera plus pragmatiques et &mdash; bien que d&eacute;vou&eacute;s &agrave; Wiccana &mdash; moins fervent que ceux qu\'ils appellent \"les brythuniens de l\'int&eacute;rieur\".&nbsp;</div>',NULL,NULL,'Baron Kerwan',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[84.484375,-56],[83.9375,-55.984375],[83.625,-56.03125],[83.25,-55.9375],[83,-55.5],[82.71875,-55.3125],[82.625,-54.90625],[82.65625,-54.5],[82.9375,-54.40625],[83.359375,-54.578125],[83.65625,-54.25],[84.0625,-53.953125],[84.40625,-53.59375],[84.75,-53.3125],[85.015625,-53.15625],[85.5,-53.09375],[86.015625,-52.96875],[86.546875,-52.90625],[87.015625,-52.859375],[87.1875,-53.21875],[87.421875,-53.609375],[87.734375,-53.953125],[88.328125,-54.109375],[88.890625,-54.171875],[89.4375,-54.4375],[89.890625,-54.796875],[90.421875,-55.171875],[90.9375,-55.703125],[91.3125,-56.1875],[91.625,-56.65625],[92.078125,-57.171875],[92.390625,-57.6875],[92.46875,-58.203125],[92.546875,-58.75],[92.78125,-59.09375],[93.0625,-59.875],[92.890625,-60.15625],[92.65625,-60.5625],[92.375,-60.8125],[91.9375,-60.90625],[91.453125,-60.8125],[90.96875,-60.484375],[90.8125,-60.078125],[90.65625,-59.609375],[90.46875,-59.234375],[90.25,-59.015625],[89.921875,-58.765625],[89.5,-58.78125],[89.234375,-58.96875],[88.78125,-59.234375],[88.5625,-59.515625],[88.109375,-59.46875],[87.9375,-59.109375],[87.71875,-58.890625],[87.421875,-58.765625],[87.078125,-58.640625],[86.765625,-58.4375],[86.34375,-58.265625],[85.984375,-58.171875],[85.65625,-57.96875],[85.453125,-57.5625],[85.421875,-57.25],[85.390625,-56.921875],[85.34375,-56.640625],[85.328125,-56.265625],[85.109375,-56.015625],[84.484375,-56]]]}}','#c0ccf9',35,15,3,'c466cf8f71caa4742a67ac8db53d5dc9.png',NULL,'stable',NULL,3,NULL),(276,379,NULL,17,13,15,'Nom_276','<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Suk<span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">met est une cit&eacute; du sud de la Stygie, construite au milieu des prairies &agrave; la fronti&egrave;re sud du pays. Son architecture est oppressante, comme dans toutes les cit&eacute;s stygiennes, bien qu&rsquo;elle soit influenc&eacute;e par les styles des Royaumes Noirs et d&rsquo;Iranistan. Elle accueillait jusqu&rsquo;&agrave; peu de nombreux contingent de mercenaires &eacute;tranger afin de prot&eacute;ger les fronti&egrave;res des pillards venus du Darfar Sukhmet poss&egrave;de un contingent comptant une petite centaine de soldats stygiens, et d&rsquo;une grande quantit&eacute; de mercenaire afin de pacifier la zone, le pharaon pr&eacute;f&eacute;rant verser une paie aux &eacute;trangers plut&ocirc;t que de sacrifier de fiers stygiens &agrave; la sauvagerie des Darfari. Mais la zone connait une certaine d&eacute;mobilisation depuis l&rsquo;annexion du fief de Ghanata.</span></p>','Sukhmet',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[71.90625,-117.10416650772095],[71.4375,-116.51041650772095],[72.25,-115.04166650772095],[72.84375,-112.85416650772095],[73.65625,-110.91666650772095],[73.5,-109.97916650772095],[76.78125,-109.57291650772095],[77.90625,-110.19791650772095],[79.125,-110.76041650772095],[80.375,-112.69791650772095],[79.71875,-113.13541650772095],[79.28125,-114.04166650772095],[79.5,-114.85416650772095],[81.21875,-115.35416650772095],[82.25,-115.76041650772095],[82.46875,-116.38541650772095],[81.5,-116.26041650772095],[80.4375,-116.10416650772095],[79.90625,-116.07291650772095],[79.1875,-115.76041650772095],[78.65625,-115.35416650772095],[77.6875,-115.29166650772095],[77.09375,-114.66666650772095],[76.84375,-114.63541650772095],[75.9375,-115.22916650772095],[75.3125,-115.44791650772095],[74.46875,-115.44791650772095],[73.90625,-115.41666650772095],[73.25,-115.79166650772095],[72.75,-116.16666650772095],[72.46875,-116.69791650772095],[71.90625,-117.10416650772095]]]}}','#f8fcab',19,15,3,NULL,NULL,'instable',NULL,1,NULL),(277,422,NULL,3,10,NULL,'Nom_277','<p>Le Nord de la Brythunie est constitu&eacute; de vastes alpages creus&eacute;s par les torrents et domin&eacute;s au Nord par les Mont Graskaal. Les crues violentes du fleuve dans ces r&eacute;gions et la pr&eacute;sence de la fronti&egrave;re avec la fronti&egrave;re hyperbor&eacute;enne ont pouss&eacute;es les habitants de cette r&eacute;gion &agrave; s\'installer sur l\'altiplano, qui b&eacute;n&eacute;ficie d\'un exceptionnel ensoleillement. On y voit pa&icirc;tre de grand troupeaux, pour l\'essentiel de moutons autour des villages install&eacute;s sur les replats. La capitale, Charnina garde de l\'&eacute;poque r&eacute;volue de guerre ouverte avec l\'Hyperbor&eacute;e les marques d&eacute;fraichies d\'un prestige lointain, monuments poussi&eacute;reux et murailles partiellement en ruines.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[85.84375,-44.609375],[86.34375,-45.078125],[86.875,-45.4375],[87.359375,-45.8125],[88.265625,-45.96875],[89.03125,-46.140625],[89.671875,-46.4375],[89.9375,-46.921875],[90.21875,-47.28125],[90.828125,-47.578125],[91.546875,-47.625],[92.078125,-47.9375],[92.46875,-48.09375],[92.859375,-48.390625],[93.9375,-48.578125],[94.390625,-48.625],[94.828125,-48.890625],[95.4375,-49.21875],[96.109375,-49.4375],[96.34375,-49.125],[96.6875,-48.734375],[96.734375,-48.375],[96.640625,-47.96875],[96.34375,-47.625],[96.265625,-47.328125],[96.25,-46.9375],[96.328125,-46.40625],[96.671875,-45.953125],[96.890625,-45.484375],[97.203125,-44.859375],[97.328125,-44.421875],[97.390625,-43.953125],[97.421875,-43.578125],