Nom_288','<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-f32fec88-4255-7dd7-cd16-3fb1fa60541f\">Les Panth&egrave;res pensent que leur totem les prot&egrave;ge mieux la nuit, et on les voit souvent enduit de pigments noirs pour les rendre plus discret et traquer leurs proies. Ils v&eacute;n&egrave;rent avant tout la sauvagerie du guerrier solitaire et ceux qui sont les derniers &agrave; rester debout sur le champ de bataille, quels que soient les moyens utilis&eacute;s. Beaucoup sont ainsi morts seuls en tant que traqueurs dans les terres pourries. Les panth&egrave;res n&rsquo;ont pas de chef civil, seulement un chef de guerre. Depuis que le chef Nouch est mort, la tribu ne se stabilise plus. Le chef actuel a m&ecirc;me perdu le sceptre des panth&egrave;res cens&eacute; &eacute;tablir son pouvoir. </span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[24.390625,-68.953125],[24.609375,-68.625],[24.953125,-68.375],[25.359375,-67.96875],[25.703125,-67.640625],[25.953125,-67.28125],[26.078125,-67.03125],[26.625,-67.375],[27.140625,-67.625],[27.625,-67.90625],[28.0625,-68.21875],[28.1875,-68.703125],[28.25,-69.109375],[28.421875,-69.59375],[28.3125,-69.9375],[27.890625,-70.046875],[27.5625,-70.15625],[27.4375,-70.578125],[27.453125,-71.03125],[27.578125,-71.46875],[27.6875,-71.9375],[27.671875,-72.296875],[27.484375,-72.640625],[27.1875,-73.03125],[26.9375,-73.296875],[26.59375,-73.65625],[26.234375,-73.921875],[25.890625,-74.046875],[25.46875,-74.078125],[25,-74.15625],[24.703125,-74.21875],[24.640625,-74.53125],[24.5,-75.015625],[24.59375,-75.296875],[24.65625,-75.75],[24.734375,-76.15625],[24.890625,-76.609375],[25.078125,-77.03125],[25.203125,-77.390625],[25.203125,-77.734375],[25,-78.125],[24.859375,-78.375],[24.359375,-78.578125],[23.796875,-78.5625],[23.4375,-78.390625],[23.234375,-77.921875],[22.96875,-77.625],[22.375,-77.203125],[22.046875,-76.890625],[21.640625,-76.5625],[21.5,-76.1875],[21.296875,-75.765625],[21.296875,-75.265625],[21.359375,-74.875],[21.546875,-74.53125],[21.984375,-74.3125],[22.625,-74.125],[23.078125,-73.828125],[23.390625,-73.296875],[23.421875,-72.84375],[23.375,-72.390625],[23.265625,-71.765625],[23.25,-71.203125],[23.484375,-70.6875],[23.625,-70.296875],[24.0625,-69.515625],[24.390625,-68.953125]]]}}','#b277e5',239,10,3,NULL,NULL,'instable',NULL,2,NULL),(289,5,NULL,7,34,13,'Nom_289','<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-f32fec88-4256-3754-d17b-d298fee1d36a\">Tr&egrave;s bon nageurs et plongeurs, mais surtout en raison de leur mental : les loutres se font une fiert&eacute; de ne pas avoir de limite, de pouvoir aller l&agrave; o&ugrave; m&ecirc;me les autres pictes ne vont pas. On associe clairement cette mentalit&eacute; &agrave; marcher sur le chemin de la folie. Les loutres sont fi&egrave;res de leurs poils et ne les coupent jamais. Les loutres ne g&acirc;chent rien et r&eacute;utilise tout ce qu&rsquo;elles peuvent. On dit qu&rsquo;il n&rsquo;y a pas plus maigres fant&ocirc;mes que ceux des loutres. </span></p>',NULL,NULL,'Lapoga Mog',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[14.890625,-72.25],[15.296875,-71.9375],[15.640625,-71.484375],[15.90625,-71.140625],[16.296875,-70.8125],[16.546875,-70.4375],[16.453125,-70.1875],[16.859375,-70],[17.265625,-69.9375],[17.75,-69.890625],[18.25,-70],[18.9375,-70],[19.515625,-69.9375],[20.21875,-69.796875],[20.796875,-69.59375],[21.359375,-69.171875],[21.78125,-68.78125],[22.15625,-68.375],[22.5,-67.859375],[22.921875,-67.671875],[23.625,-67.59375],[24.171875,-67.421875],[24.640625,-67.484375],[25.140625,-67.625],[25.4375,-67.75],[25.046875,-68.078125],[24.828125,-68.40625],[24.5,-68.875],[24.1875,-69.359375],[23.84375,-69.875],[23.640625,-70.34375],[23.4375,-70.890625],[23.265625,-71.390625],[23.25,-72.046875],[23.359375,-72.5625],[23.546875,-73.09375],[23.359375,-73.59375],[22.921875,-73.875],[22.53125,-74.1875],[22.015625,-74.34375],[21.65625,-74.546875],[21.421875,-74.8125],[21.234375,-75.359375],[21.328125,-75.875],[21.515625,-76.375],[21.828125,-76.734375],[22.234375,-77.046875],[22.609375,-77.328125],[22.890625,-77.6875],[23.21875,-78.078125],[23.484375,-78.53125],[23.4375,-79.109375],[23.25,-79.609375],[23.0625,-80.09375],[22.90625,-80.578125],[22.796875,-81.03125],[22.796875,-81.53125],[22.578125,-81.828125],[22.21875,-82.0625],[21.65625,-82.1875],[21.171875,-82.265625],[20.59375,-82.4375],[20.34375,-82.90625],[20.15625,-83.265625],[20.09375,-83.578125],[19.75,-83.71875],[19.328125,-84.015625],[18.734375,-84.125],[18.34375,-84.234375],[17.96875,-84.328125],[17.546875,-84.484375],[16.953125,-84.75],[16.6875,-85.1875],[16.390625,-85.5],[15.875,-85.671875],[15.4375,-85.890625],[14.921875,-85.890625],[14.328125,-85.796875],[14.421875,-85.234375],[14.578125,-85.015625],[14.65625,-84.546875],[14.875,-84.09375],[14.921875,-83.65625],[14.828125,-83.234375],[14.671875,-82.671875],[14.484375,-82.125],[14.28125,-81.546875],[14.1875,-81.015625],[14.203125,-80.578125],[14.40625,-80.203125],[14.953125,-79.890625],[15.46875,-79.59375],[15.140625,-79.328125],[14.8125,-79.109375],[14.71875,-78.75],[14.84375,-78.359375],[15.203125,-78.0625],[15.21875,-77.625],[15.21875,-77.125],[15.1875,-76.734375],[14.734375,-76.4375],[14.359375,-76.15625],[14.078125,-75.609375],[14.3125,-75.40625],[14.390625,-75],[14.46875,-74.625],[14.5,-74.125],[14.515625,-73.5],[14.53125,-73.015625],[14.625,-72.5],[14.890625,-72.25]]]}}','#fcd7a6',239,10,3,NULL,NULL,'instable',NULL,2,NULL),(294,43,NULL,6,20,NULL,'Nom_294','<p>Atzel est le territoire du baron voyou. La forteresse d\'Atzel se tient &agrave; l\'entr&eacute;e de la passe d\'Ymir qui permet d\'acc&eacute;der &agrave; la Cimm&eacute;rie et est faites d\'agglom&eacute;rations de blocs de pierres sans mortiers. Conan en personne a tu&eacute; le Baron mais croyez le ou non, un autre a prit sa place et contribue de pr&eacute;lever des tribus sur celles et ceux qui veulent traverser.&nbsp;<br /><br />Depuis quelques ann&eacute;es les Atzelois ont d&eacute;velopp&eacute;s leurs services et proposent de se faire payer comme escortes pour les Aquiloniens qui souhaiteraient traverser tranquillement les Royaumes Fronti&egrave;res.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[62.109375,-48.265625],[62.5,-47.953125],[62.875,-47.734375],[63.375,-47.578125],[63.921875,-47.484375],[64.578125,-47.5],[65.09375,-47.59375],[65.0625,-48.265625],[65.125,-48.875],[65.203125,-49.578125],[65.234375,-50.1875],[65.1875,-50.78125],[65.015625,-51.359375],[64.90625,-51.953125],[64.859375,-52.453125],[64.953125,-52.90625],[65.015625,-53.421875],[64.890625,-53.921875],[64.9375,-54.578125],[64.984375,-54.984375],[64.5625,-55.0625],[64.078125,-55.21875],[63.5625,-55.265625],[63.109375,-55.265625],[62.71875,-55.140625],[62.421875,-55.296875],[62.125,-55.59375],[61.90625,-55.65625],[61.359375,-55.921875],[60.78125,-55.828125],[60.28125,-55.8125],[59.953125,-55.53125],[59.78125,-55.25],[59.65625,-54.9375],[59.546875,-54.40625],[60,-54.3125],[60.375,-54.125],[60.84375,-53.890625],[61.125,-53.484375],[61.15625,-53.1875],[61.109375,-52.953125],[60.859375,-52.6875],[60.5,-52.5625],[60.1875,-52.3125],[59.890625,-51.921875],[60.0625,-51.53125],[60.4375,-51.15625],[60.765625,-50.671875],[60.953125,-50.203125],[61.140625,-49.8125],[61.265625,-49.359375],[61.40625,-48.96875],[61.484375,-48.546875],[62.109375,-48.265625]]]}}','#b2ffbb',182,10,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,NULL),(295,43,NULL,6,20,NULL,'Nom_295','<p>Le Baron local est r&eacute;put&eacute; pour son hospitalit&eacute; toute particuli&egrave;re. Prox&eacute;n&egrave;te de son &eacute;tat il ne manquera pas de proposer de la compagnie pour la nuit &agrave; tout voyageurs passant dans le coin.&nbsp;La pratique n\'est pas sans danger car la petite v&eacute;role est ici un mal courant. <br /><br />Toutefois un aventurier philosophe relativisera volontiers la situation et n\'h&eacute;sitera pas une seconde car la perspective d\'attraper une petite v&eacute;role est presque r&eacute;jouissante &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; des autres dangers des basses terres. Une partie du fief est en effet occup&eacute; par la lande hant&eacute;e. Un chaos g&eacute;ologique noir qui en guise de fant&ocirc;mes est occup&eacute; des &ecirc;tres bels et biens vivants : les Yemlis. Des humano&iuml;des tordus aux yeux rouges dont le niveau de d&eacute;g&eacute;n&eacute;rescence ferait p&acirc;lir un sectateur de Yog. Jusqu\'il y a peu on parlait d\'eux seulement comme des l&eacute;gendes pour faire peur aux petits enfants \"si tu finis par ta soupe je te donnerai &agrave; manger aux Yemlis\". Sauf que depuis quelques ann&eacute;es ils semblerait qu\'ils soient vraiment apparus... du coup on en rigole beaucoup moins.<br /><br />Bref, quand on survit aux Yemlis, on peut bien survivre &agrave; une prostitu&eacute;e de Solunia non?</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[64.984375,-47.484375],[65.078125,-48.0625],[65.125,-48.5625],[65.1875,-49.125],[65.25,-49.90625],[65.84375,-50.09375],[66.34375,-50.171875],[67.015625,-50.234375],[67.625,-50.109375],[68.171875,-49.984375],[68.65625,-49.828125],[69.171875,-49.625],[69.59375,-49.484375],[69.96875,-49.390625],[70.640625,-49.375],[71.0625,-49.28125],[71.53125,-49.28125],[71.8125,-49.453125],[72.21875,-49.78125],[72.75,-49.484375],[73.1875,-49.28125],[73.71875,-48.90625],[74.21875,-48.59375],[73.875,-48.203125],[73.546875,-47.671875],[73.203125,-47.15625],[73.078125,-46.75],[72.921875,-46.234375],[72.765625,-45.53125],[72.5,-45.171875],[72.21875,-44.875],[71.875,-44.71875],[71.421875,-44.46875],[71.203125,