y\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[135.640625,-111.92194837331772],[134.84375,-112.00007337331772],[134.234375,-112.09382337331772],[133.796875,-112.10944837331772],[133.28125,-111.87507337331772],[133.015625,-111.73444837331772],[132.53125,-111.81257337331772],[132.0625,-111.81257337331772],[131.921875,-111.57819837331772],[131.96875,-111.07819837331772],[132.15625,-110.71882337331772],[132.625,-110.53132337331772],[132.921875,-110.20319837331772],[133.0625,-109.73444837331772],[133.265625,-109.28132337331772],[133.421875,-108.87507337331772],[133.890625,-108.59382337331772],[134.203125,-108.29694837331772],[134.59375,-107.98444837331772],[134.734375,-108.53132337331772],[134.875,-109.01569837331772],[135.25,-109.20319837331772],[135.578125,-109.59382337331772],[135.953125,-109.82819837331772],[136.484375,-110.09382337331772],[136.921875,-110.25007337331772],[137.234375,-110.14069837331772],[137.703125,-109.85944837331772],[138.140625,-109.68757337331772],[138.6875,-109.68757337331772],[139.125,-109.95319837331772],[139.796875,-110.21882337331772],[140.203125,-110.10944837331772],[140.6875,-110.01569837331772],[140.828125,-109.75007337331772],[141.234375,-109.65632337331772],[141.8125,-109.46882337331772],[142.140625,-109.17194837331772],[142.6875,-108.90632337331772],[143.078125,-109.26569837331772],[143.40625,-109.50007337331772],[143.9375,-109.65632337331772],[144.328125,-109.70319837331772],[144.640625,-109.92194837331772],[144.546875,-110.34382337331772],[144.609375,-110.81257337331772],[144.796875,-111.18757337331772],[145.203125,-111.26569837331772],[145.4375,-111.37507337331772],[145.4375,-111.68757337331772],[145.359375,-112.10944837331772],[145.359375,-112.59382337331772],[145.15625,-113.18757337331772],[145.015625,-113.60944837331772],[144.453125,-113.60944837331772],[143.953125,-113.67194837331772],[143.453125,-113.75007337331772],[143.15625,-114.00007337331772],[142.9375,-114.45319837331772],[142.6875,-114.89069837331772],[142.15625,-115.06257337331772],[141.84375,-115.17194837331772],[141.65625,-115.50007337331772],[141.328125,-115.53132337331772],[140.8125,-115.68757337331772],[140.25,-115.76569837331772],[140.21875,-116.15632337331772],[140.34375,-116.60944837331772],[140.34375,-117.00007337331772],[140.125,-117.45319837331772],[139.84375,-117.23444837331772],[139.640625,-116.71882337331772],[139.453125,-116.42194837331772],[139.125,-116.25007337331772],[138.75,-115.93757337331772],[138.71875,-115.26569837331772],[138.890625,-114.76569837331772],[138.625,-114.53132337331772],[138.28125,-114.32819837331772],[137.953125,-114.01569837331772],[137.453125,-113.76569837331772],[137.171875,-113.35944837331772],[136.9375,-112.45319837331772],[136.515625,-112.32819837331772],[136.28125,-112.12507337331772],[135.640625,-111.92194837331772]]]}}','#7ad4f4',127,15,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL),(376,NULL,NULL,1,23,33,'Nom_376','<p>Kirjahan &eacute;tait un bref Royaume s&eacute;cessionniste de l&rsquo;ancien Ophir. Il a &eacute;t&eacute;&nbsp;fond&eacute; sur les cendres de la guerre civile qui a oppos&eacute; Terson &agrave; Mecanta. La conciliation impossible, il ne restait plus que la partition du pays comme seule solution envisageable.<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-08140eea-0cda-6682-f288-383e1e0b7aec\"> </span><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-08140eea-0cda-6682-f288-383e1e0b7aec\">Kirjahan &eacute;tait jadis le coeur de la nation Ophirienne, ainsi que son grenier &agrave; bl&eacute;. La capitale royale et les terres l&rsquo;entourant. De cette &eacute;poque r&eacute;volue restent encore de hautes tours et une administration rod&eacute;e. Il reste &eacute;galement le faste et le luxe d\'une ville qui fut parmi les plus riches d\'Hybor&eacute;e. </span><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-08140eea-0cda-6682-f288-383e1e0b7aec\">Mais en raison de la guerre la mis&egrave;re a progress&eacute;, tous les villages d&eacute;truits par la guerre civile n&rsquo;ont pas encore &eacute;t&eacute; reconstruits et nombreux sont les indigents qui ont tout perdus et vivent d&eacute;sormais sans le sous. Quant &agrave; l&rsquo;aristocratie? La d&eacute;cadence semble y prosp&eacute;rer. </span><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-08140eea-0cda-6682-f288-383e1e0b7aec\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial; color: #0c343d; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br class=\"kix-line-break\" /></span></span></p>','Ianthe','Monarchie','Septime Quintillus Valérien','200 000','Couronne jaune sur champ rouge','civilisé','Peau plutôt mate, cheveux noirs.','Fin d\'Empire romain mixé avec les influences du début des invasions barbares.','Armement lourd : Arbalète, bouclier rond, épée large et lance d\'arçon pour les chevaliers.','Relativement proches de l\'Aquilonie mais plus luxueux (armures dorées, bijoux,...). Les notables peuvent porter toges et tuniques.','Fin en \"US / O\" ( Fratus, Derto, Maximus, Damiano ).','Début en \"O\", fin en \"A\"  ( Orallia, Ornella, Feressa, Amasia ).','Au nord et à  l\'ouest : Fleuve Rouge / Aquilonie \r\nA l\'est : Passe d\'Oteron / Némédie\r\nAu Sud : Mont Karpash / Ophir','extended',NULL,'#d60ea4',NULL,0,0,'b1cb6b7cb5ed3366f0a570ffcb241cdf.png',NULL,'stable',NULL,2,NULL),(377,14,NULL,2,7,3,'Nom_377','<p>Il s\'agit de la partie la plus riche et la plus verdoyante du pays. Sa population est principalement compos&eacute;e de s&eacute;dentaires cultivateurs de c&eacute;r&eacute;ales et de bergers qui veillent sur les troupeaux de moutons.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[54.8125,-103.4375],[57.375,-99.5625],[61.5,-98.4375],[64.4375,-94.9375],[63.625,-93.125],[64.4375,-91.0625],[66.125,-91.875],[68.125,-91.6875],[68.3125,-90.9375],[70.4375,-91.375],[71.625,-92.6875],[73.1875,-92.3125],[77.3125,-92.4375],[78.5,-94],[80.375,-93.875],[81.5,-94.375],[84.5625,-94.4375],[85.3125,-93.625],[85.8125,-93.875],[86.875,-96.5],[87.6875,-97.1875],[85.75,-98.4375],[86.875,-100.5],[87.375,-101.875],[86.5625,-104.6875],[85.25,-104.625],[83,-105.1875],[80.6875,-104.8125],[77.5625,-105.25],[76.6875,-104.5625],[73.75,-104.4375],[71.9375,-105.1875],[70.625,-103.9375],[67.6875,-104.6875],[62.5625,-103.1875],[60.1875,-103.9375],[58.625,-103.5],[56.625,-104.625],[55.1875,-104.3125],[54.8125,-103.4375]]]}}','#f9be90',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'stable',NULL,2,NULL),(378,14,NULL,9,7,9,'Nom_378','<p>C\'est la partie la plus aride du pays. Les gens y vivent depuis des g&eacute;n&eacute;rations &agrave; la mode des nomades, dirig&eacute;s par des Sheiks et avec des lois diff&eacute;rentes que chez les s&eacute;dentaires de la Shem pastorale. Attention, d&eacute;sertique ne signifie pas sans ressources. Le commerce y est florissant et les oasis et les caravans&eacute;rails apporte leur lot de richesses et de rencontres...</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[86.625,-104.5],[87.25,-101.75],[85.875,-98.3125],[87.625,-96.9375],[85.75,-93.8125],[88.125,-94.875],[90.4375,-93.9375],[92.1875,-93.9375],[92.625,-93.1875],[93.6875,-92.75],[95.1875,-92.75],[96.9375,-92],[97.75,-93.3125],[99.125,-93.375],[99.4375,-94.875],[101.25,-98.3125],[101.25,-99.4375],[100.25,-100.5625],[100.375,-101.8125],[99.625,-103.9375],[92.5625,-104],[86.625,-104.5]]]}}','#afffe7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'stable',2,2,NULL),(379,17,NULL,9,13,NULL,'Nom_379','<p>C\'est le nom que porte la division administrative des provinces qui se trouvent &agrave; l\'ouest de la Stygie. C\'est une zone plut&ocirc;t peupl&eacute;e, civilis&eacute;e, fleuron de la culture Stygienne.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[56.3125,-104.4375],[58.625,-103.625],[60.5