LL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[18.78125,-84.15625],[19.90625,-84.46875],[20.78125,-84.46875],[22.5,-85.1875],[22.34375,-85.71875],[24.4375,-86.6875],[29.9375,-88.125],[30.21875,-86.84375],[32.5,-86.78125],[34.6875,-83.9375],[33.03125,-82.78125],[31.25,-81.84375],[28.65625,-81.0625],[27.15625,-80.3125],[26.15625,-80.59375],[24.34375,-78.65625],[23.59375,-78.78125],[22.6875,-81.625],[20.6875,-82.4375],[20,-83.65625],[18.78125,-84.15625]]]}}','#e8ef83',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,NULL),(401,109,NULL,2,19,NULL,'Nom_401','<p>Sur ces terres c\'&eacute;tait le pouvoir du roi Federico de Zingara qui pr&eacute;dominait.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Elle fait d&eacute;sormais partie de la <strong>R&eacute;publique imp&eacute;riale d\'Argos et Zingara et ses colonies </strong></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[14.28125,-85.9375],[16.15625,-85.65625],[17.65625,-84.34375],[18.78125,-84.28125],[19.75,-84.625],[20.625,-84.4375],[21.875,-84.9375],[22.5,-85.34375],[22.28125,-85.71875],[24.875,-86.78125],[29.90625,-88.28125],[29.65625,-89.84375],[28.21875,-91],[26.59375,-93.9375],[26.46875,-94.5],[26.59375,-96.40625],[23.90625,-97.125],[22.71875,-98.5],[22.1875,-98.15625],[21.96875,-97.3125],[20.0625,-96.75],[20.46875,-95.28125],[19.09375,-95.21875],[18.4375,-94.59375],[17.625,-94.59375],[15.875,-92.875],[15.21875,-92.125],[15.125,-91.40625],[13.9375,-91.34375],[13.59375,-90.5625],[14.03125,-90.125],[13.03125,-89.15625],[12.78125,-88.34375],[13,-87.28125],[14.28125,-85.9375]]]}}','#f2a2de',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,NULL),(402,22,NULL,2,12,NULL,'Nom_402','<p>On trouve ici des territoires globalement montagneux et frontaliers de Zamora. Est-ce l\'influence de ce pays qui a d&eacute;teint sur cette r&eacute;gion? Probable... toujours est-il que les fiefs Corinthiens que l\'on retrouve dans cette r&eacute;gion sont globalement les plus violents de toute la Corinthie, que ce soit &agrave; cause de sombres cultes, de moeurs d&eacute;cadentes, ou bien de militarisme exacerb&eacute;.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[105.1875,-58.25],[102,-59.125],[101.375,-58.6875],[98.5625,-59.75],[97.8125,-60.3125],[97.3125,-61.1875],[97.875,-62.0625],[97,-63.5],[97.5,-64.375],[99.0625,-64.1875],[99.75,-64.4375],[99,-65.625],[98.875,-66.5],[94,-70],[96.375,-69.8125],[97.625,-70],[96.6875,-70.96875],[93.484375,-72.265625],[92.546875,-72.515625],[91.234375,-72.5],[90.390625,-73.28125],[89.1875,-75.671875],[90.875,-75.984375],[92.96875,-75.3125],[93.75,-75.890625],[94.21875,-76.515625],[95.296875,-75.359375],[96.421875,-75.015625],[97.15625,-74.0625],[98.015625,-74.015625],[98.328125,-73.125],[99.671875,-72.21875],[99.75,-71.4375],[101.625,-70],[103.125,-69.25],[102.9375,-67.625],[103.8125,-65.0625],[102.875,-64.5625],[103.0625,-63.6875],[104.1875,-63.3125],[103.9375,-62],[105.6875,-59.375],[105.1875,-58.25]]]}}','#dafc83',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,NULL),(403,22,NULL,2,12,8,'Nom_403','<p>On trouve ici des territoires globalement constitu&eacute;s de plaines et de plateaux qui constituent le coeur de la culture Corinthienne.<br /><br />Les arts, la politique, le raffinement, la gastronomie &agrave; la Corinthienne sont n&eacute;s ici et quand un &eacute;tranger pense au clich&eacute; d\'un Corinthien c\'est probablement qu\'il pense &agrave; un habitant de cette r&eacute;gion.&nbsp;</p>','Hectoropolis','Cité Etats - Monarchie parlementaire','Aïakos Andrion Hectoride #2242',NULL,NULL,'Civilisé',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[97,-63.625],[97.5,-64.437