habitude d&rsquo;interagir ensemble, que ce soit par la paix ou par la guerre.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[83.875,-131.3125],[84.8125,-129.4375],[82.875,-125.125],[81.8125,-126.25],[81.25,-127.25],[80.4375,-127.1875],[79.5,-127.625],[78,-126.6875],[77.17188,-128.39062],[75.4375,-128.48437],[74.95313,-127.9375],[73.59375,-127.57812],[72.59375,-127.53125],[71.7348,-126.67187],[72.23438,-125.5162],[71.54,-124.5],[71.95313,-123.9375],[71.406,-123.625],[70.7348,-123.73437],[69.96875,-123.4375],[69.34375,-123.53125],[68.76563,-123.01562],[66.09375,-125.07812],[65.57813,-125.125],[66.04688,-127.04687],[69.0625,-126.25],[70.5,-126.84375],[69.65625,-129.07812],[68.98438,-129.39062],[68.48438,-129.14062],[67.90625,-129.14062],[66.20313,-130.78125],[64.92188,-130.23437],[64.03125,-130.7185],[62.625,-129.84375],[62.8125,-127.9375],[61.5625,-127.4375],[61.1875,-129.125],[60.5625,-129.9375],[60.5,-131.3125],[58.4375,-132.6875],[58.25,-134.3125],[59.75,-134.125],[61,-134.75],[63.125,-134.5625],[65.5625,-135.3125],[67.125,-134],[68.4375,-133.875],[70.0625,-133.6875],[70.875,-133.875],[72.875,-132.25],[74.5,-131.875],[75.75,-131.375],[76.75,-131.5],[77.125,-132.6875],[78.4375,-132.9375],[79.25,-131.9375],[81.875,-131.5],[82.9375,-131.5],[83.875,-131.3125]]]}}','#a7f99f',3,3,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,NULL),(413,13,NULL,2,1,NULL,'Nom_413','<p>Les territoires contr&ocirc;les directement par les Pygm&eacute;s ou dans lesquels ils sont la tribu&nbsp;dominante, culturellement et&nbsp;militairement.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ils ont &eacute;t&eacute; colonis&eacute;s par les Argoss&eacute;ens d&eacute;barquant en force. Une domination de courte dur&eacute;e puisque la puissance locale kushite les a mis en fuite.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"ty