t du nord de&nbsp;Koth&nbsp;la fid&eacute;lit&eacute; au pouvoir central du Roi est la norme.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[54.4375,-86.375],[54.4375,-85.5625],[56.0625,-85.25],[57.1875,-84.375],[59.5625,-83.25],[61.6875,-82.875],[62.4375,-82.3125],[63.9375,-82.375],[65.5,-82.25],[68.1875,-82],[69.3125,-81.375],[71.6875,-81.5625],[73.1875,-81.125],[76.1875,-81.0625],[78.0625,-80.75],[82.1875,-80.5625],[84.9375,-80.875],[86.4375,-80.5],[88.0625,-79.375],[89.6875,-79.8125],[88.6875,-82.625],[87.6875,-83.5625],[86.8125,-83.125],[85.6875,-82.5],[84.5,-82.75],[83.25,-83.5],[80.9375,-83.75],[77.9375,-84.875],[74.4375,-86],[72.75,-86.125],[71.1875,-86.75],[70.21875,-86.1875],[62.25,-87.53125],[61.15625,-87.21875],[59.0625,-88],[57.4375,-86.8125],[55.5625,-86.5],[54.4375,-86.375]]]}}','#c0ea72',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,NULL),(417,443,NULL,2,17,NULL,'Nom_417','<p>On trouve dans cette partie des Escarpements Kothiens, deux territoires historiquement turbulents et en d&eacute;fiance par rapport au pouvoir central.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>NOTE ORGA : collines de Dagoth et Baronnie de Korveka. R&eacute;gion non utilis&eacute;e actuellement</p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #222222; font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; margin-bottom: 0cm;\">&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended',NULL,'#f99990',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,NULL),(418,443,NULL,2,17,12,'Nom_418','<p>Pour un Kothien de Korshemirsh qui se prom&egrave;nerait dans ces territoires de l\'extr&ecirc;me est du royaume le d&eacute;paysement pourrait &ecirc;tre total. Les influences culturelles des pays voisins sont fortes dans la pointe Kothienne, quand &agrave; Anuphar.... bien que depuis 10 ans les m&oelig;urs Kothiennes s\'y importent, le territoire reste culturellement Corinthien. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>NOTE ORGA : R&eacute;gion regroupant Anuphar et?? Non utilis&eacute;e actuellement</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended',NULL,'#f771e1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,NULL),(419,81,NULL,9,16,NULL,'Nom_419','<p>On trouve ici les territoires tropicaux du sud de Vendhya.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[174.6875,-145.3125],[174.6875,-144.5625],[175.9375,-143.375],[176.1875,-141.8125],[177.5,-140.5],[178.5,-140.0625],[178.5,-138.5],[178.125,-136.8125],[179.6875,-136.0625],[180.375,-133.25],[179.6875,-132.625],[178.8125,-131.625],[177.875,-131.125],[177.0625,-132.5625],[175.4375,-132.5625],[175.0625,-131.5625],[172.5625,-131],[170.5,-131.0625],[169.25,-131.375],[167.625,-131.875],[167.375,-133.375],[167.9375,-134.9375],[167.5625,-135.625],[166,-136.125],[163.5,-136.0625],[163.125,-136.75],[163.9375,-137.875],[164.625,-139.125],[165.0625,-140.5625],[166,-141.875],[167.8125,-142.625],[168.8125,-144.4375],[169.9375,-145.25],[170.59375,-144.84375],[171.40625,-145.9375],[172.84375,-145.5625],[173.28125,-145.4375],[174.40625,-145.65625],[174.6875,-145.3125]]]}}','#f9acdc',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,NULL),(420,81,NULL,2,16,NULL,'Nom_420','<p>Des territoires de plaines souvent exploit&eacute;s par une agriculture vivace.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[178.4375,-131.25],[180.375,-130.0625],[181.125,-128.5625],[180.984375,-127.65625],[182.828125,-127.15625],[183.296875,-125.78125],[182.296875,-124.625],[183.015625,-124.1875],[183.984375,-122.03125],[183.765625,-120.875],[183.265625,-120.84375],[183.484375,-118.46875],[183.296875,-117.84375],[184.921875,-115.8125],[184.515625,-115.5],[182.734375,-115.875],[181.453125,-114.