LL,2,7,12,'Nom_440','<p>Shem &eacute;tend son influence de fa&ccedil;on diplomatique comme pour Khoraja mais aussi militairement comme pour les fiefs du sud de Koth qui composent cette nouvelle r&eacute;gion.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[71.046875,-86.75],[71.625,-86.5625],[72.1875,-86.359375],[72.859375,-86.296875],[73.5,-86.265625],[74.421875,-86.109375],[75.109375,-86],[75.6875,-85.75],[76.4375,-85.546875],[77.046875,-85.34375],[77.65625,-85.09375],[78.09375,-84.9375],[78.171875,-85.484375],[78.28125,-86.125],[78.5,-86.703125],[79.015625,-87.90625],[79.453125,-88.453125],[79.78125,-89.03125],[80.078125,-89.546875],[80.546875,-89.96875],[80.8125,-90.359375],[81.359375,-91.203125],[81,-91.46875],[80.671875,-91.46875],[80.328125,-91.484375],[79.875,-91.640625],[79.375,-91.8125],[78.71875,-92.03125],[78.21875,-92.28125],[77.796875,-92.328125],[77.3125,-92.53125],[76.78125,-92.53125],[76.328125,-92.609375],[75.953125,-92.6875],[75.53125,-92.671875],[74.9375,-92.59375],[74.453125,-92.515625],[74.0625,-92.109375],[73.734375,-91.78125],[73.34375,-91.203125],[73.078125,-90.921875],[72.734375,-90.59375],[72.453125,-90.3125],[72.09375,-90.125],[72.046875,-89.703125],[72,-89.34375],[71.765625,-89.015625],[71.859375,-88.671875],[71.921875,-88.34375],[71.765625,-88.03125],[71.484375,-87.734375],[71.234375,-87.484375],[71.09375,-87.078125],[71.046875,-86.75]]]}}','#928fe8',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'stable',NULL,3,NULL),(441,44,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,'Nom_441','<p>La N&eacute;m&eacute;die a appris de ses d&eacute;faites face &agrave; son puissant voisin aquilonien et reporte ses ambitions territoriales sur des pays moins puissants comme Ophir ou les Royaumes fronti&egrave;res.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[70.28125,-51.515625],[70.78125,-50.984375],[71.1875,-50.5],[71.578125,-50.09375],[72.171875,-49.765625],[72.859375,-49.40625],[73.421875,-49.015625],[73.921875,-48.671875],[74.421875,-48.359375],[75.015625,-47.734375],[75.546875,-47.234375],[75.96875,-46.765625],[76.625,-46.453125],[77.09375,-46.1875],[77.578125,-45.9375],[78.125,-45.65625],[78.671875,-45.421875],[79.875,-44.6875],[80.421875,-44.328125],[81.296875,-43.65625],[81.234375,-44.1875],[81.15625,-44.75],[81.328125,-45.375],[81.5625,-46.078125],[81.03125,-46.234375],[80.390625,-46.59375],[79.828125,-46.734375],[79.15625,-47.046875],[78.65625,-47.3125],[78.53125,-47.734375],[78.21875,-47.96875],[77.640625,-48.28125],[77.328125,-48.71875],[77.078125,-49.109375],[77.046875,-49.546875],[76.9375,-49.84375],[76.6875,-50.3125],[76.359375,-50.640625],[75.953125,-50.984375],[75.453125,-51.046875],[75.046875,-51.265625],[75.140625,-51.609375],[74.859375,-51.90625],[74.46875,-51.90625],[73.9375,-51.984375],[73.546875,-51.984375],[73.125,-52.140625],[72.796875,-52.375],[72.421875,-52.484375],[71.8125,-52.5625],[71.40625,-52.671875],[70.859375,-52.65625],[70.59375,-52.53125],[70.296875,-52.390625],[70.046875,-52.1875],[69.859375,-51.921875],[70.046875,-51.734375],[70.28125,-51.515625]]]}}','#71eda3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,3,NULL),(442,80,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,'Nom_442','<p>Asgard a entrepris une politique de conqu&ecirc;te territoriale sur l\'est. Les Royaumes fronti&egrave;res en ont fait les frais.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[77.5625,-40.25],[78.53125,-39.21875],[78.875,-38.46875],[80.34375,-38.40625],[80.75,-38.1875],[81.3125,-37.4375],[81.71875,-37.59375],[82.03125,-37.21875],[84.5,-35.875],[84.71875,-35.375],[85.15625,-34.625],[86.0625,-33.90625],[86.8125,-33.96875],[86.46875,-34.46875],[86.21875,-35.09375],[86.21875,-35.5625],[85.1875,-36.0625],[85.34375,-36.71875],[85.25,-37.4375],[84.5625,-38.0625],[84.71875,-38.90625],[84.6875,-39.1875],[84.15625,-39.40625],[83.75,-39.90625],[83.75,-40.46875],[84.03125,-40.8125],[83.84375,-41.46875],[83.25,-41.625],[82.8125,-42.03125],[82.4375,-42.53125],[81.875,-43.15625],[80.53125,-44.15625],[80.34375,-44.28125],[79.375,-43.375],[79.09375,-42.53125],[78.96875,-41.625],[78.5625,-40.875],[77.5625,-40.25]]]}}','#ef79fc',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,3,NULL),(443,NULL,NULL,15,17,NULL,'Nom_443','<p>N&eacute; de la fusion entre Koth et la Corinthie du nord, ce nouvel empire doit faire face &agrave; un morcellement de son territoire.</p>\r\n<p>Enosis est un tr&egrave;s jeune empire au regard de l\'histoire du monde d\'Hybor&eacute;e.&nbsp;Pourtant son origine poss&egrave;de de solides et profondes racines.&nbsp;Parmi les &eacute;rudits, les plus sages attestent que l\'empire est n&eacute; de la rencontre entre l\'Archonte-Roi de Khumar de Corinthie \"Iaros le fl&eacute;au\" et de la Reine de Koth&nbsp;\"Khalisar\". Tous deux ambitieux, tous deux protecteurs, ils comprirent&nbsp;que l\'union ferait leur force et qu\'il fallait cesser d\'&ecirc;tre des pi&egrave;ces mineures sur le grand plateau de jeu qu\'&eacute;tait le Monde d\'Hybor&eacute;e. Mais bien peu des leurs &eacute;tait de leur avis et le plus grand nombre eut raison d\'eux, ainsi ils obtinrent victoire par le tr&eacute;pas des deux amants qu\'ils &eacute;taient devenus.</p>\r\n<p>Mais une id&eacute;e ne peut mourir, une v&eacute;rit&eacute; ne peut dispara&icirc;tre, une destin&eacute;e ne peut ne pas s\'accomplir. Apr&egrave;s avoir sem&eacute; les graines du chaos, ces faibles et ignares obscurantistes &eacute;crivaient en v&eacute;rit&eacute; l\'Histoire: pour sa s&eacute;curit&eacute;, l\'h&eacute;riti&egrave;re du tr&ocirc;ne de Koth -la Princesse C&eacute;l&eacute;na- fut confi&eacute;e &agrave; la protection du R&eacute;gent de Corinthie Goros&nbsp;! Peu de temps apr&egrave;s, la princesse s\'unit au r&eacute;gent unissant de fait leurs deux royaumes pour mettre au monde l\'empire d\'Enosis&nbsp;! Mais cette naissance ne fut pas au go&ucirc;t de tous: des fiefs corinthiens s\'affranchirent et le Sh&eacute;mite de p&egrave;re de C&eacute;l&eacute;na s\'accapara de fiefs kothiens&nbsp;!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>L\'Empire naquit amput&eacute; et seul l\'avenir dira si l\'Empereur et l\'imp&eacute;ratrice accepteront d\'&ecirc;tre incomplets. L\'empire sera un ou ne sera pas...?</p>',NULL,'Empire','L\'Impératrice Céléna et l\'Empereur Goros','390 000 +5 700 000',NULL,'Civilisé','.Type méditerranéen, barbe taillée fréquente\r\n.Peau très mate, cheveux longs','.Grèce antique héllénique \r\n.Hittites','Glaive, bouclier rond et lance\r\nGlaive, lance, arc, grand bouclier','.Chiton, tunique, plastron, casque à  cimier\r\n.Hommes : Cotte de mailles, armure de plaques, casque, tunique fermées en bandoulière, jupe. Pectoral possible si rang social élev. Femmes : pectoral de pierres et de perles ou de métal, drapé et tuniques, bijoux, boucles d\'oreilles.','.Fin en « IS , AS et ES (Léonidas, Iasonas, Elias, Urgos, Yiannis, Gavrilos )\r\n.Fin en \" ULI, ARA ,ON, UR\" ( Hattsuli, Kusara, Sargon, Assur )','.Fin en «A, OPE, INA » ( Penelope, Pelaya, Talina)\r\n.Fin en \" UMAR, ISAR, IN\" ( Supiluliumar, Alisar, Naram-sin)',NULL,'extended','{\"type\":\"Feature\",\"properties\":{},\"geometry\":{\"type\":\"MultiPolygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[[94.21875,-76.59375],[93.59375,-77],[92.90625,-77.09375],[93.03125,-77.6875],[93.3125,-78.09375],[92.6875,-78.34375],[92.125,-78.71875],[92.3125,-79.46875],[91.09375,-79.90625],[89.96875,-79.8125],[89.1875,-81.875],[87.78125,-83.71875],[87.25,-82.96875],[85.65625,-82.75],[84.46875,-82.90625],[83.28125,-83.78125],[80.9375,-83.75],[77.75,-84.84375],[75.03125,-85.9375],[73.0625,-86.0625],[71.125,-86.8125],[71.71875,-88.0625],[72,-89.71875],[72.5,-90.46875],[73.46875,-91.1875],[74.34375,-92.65625],[73.875,-92.8125],[71.28125,-92.4375],[70.4375,-91.5],[69.5625,-91.06